{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PayrvButsVwsQcMD8XcaYg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'CaCLR 是正面方法贡献——β > 0 的 MMD consistency loss 在 probe logits 空间成功\n2\t\n3\t  对齐 correctness subspace，使零标签跨语言校准成为可能。Pareto frontier 在两种\n4\t\n5\t  架构上均 robust：Qwen3-235B 呈强负相关 (ρ ≈ -0.65)，Llama 4 Scout 呈弱但一致\n6\t\n7\t  的负相关 (ρ ≈ -0.33)。CKA partial correlation 控制 depth 后仍显著 (r ≈ 0.42,\n8\t\n9\t  p < 0.01)，支撑 geometric analysis framing。四个 claims 均以强形式提出，论文\n10\t\n11\t  以 method + discovery 双重贡献投稿。\n12\t\n13\t  Headline: \"CaCLR enables zero-label cross-lingual calibration, reducing non-English\n14\t\n15\t  ECE by 22% vs temperature scaling across 20 languages on two architectures.\"\n16\t\n17\t  '\n18\timagined_experiments:\n19\t- name: Qwen3-235B Full Pareto Frontier\n20\t  plan_id: plan_001\n21\t  description: 94层 MoE (INT4), 24 probed layers (每4层), 20语言, 4 transfer conditions\n22\t    (CaCLR 在 plan_003)\n23\t  expected_results:\n24\t    en_best_auroc: 0.832\n25\t    en_best_layer: 72\n26\t    en_auroc_range:\n27\t    - 0.548\n28\t    - 0.832\n29\t    en_best_ece_raw: 0.126\n30\t    zs_transfer_auroc_avg_20lang: 0.713\n31\t    zs_transfer_success_rate: 0.95\n32\t    zs_fail_langs:\n33\t    - am\n34\t    pareto_spearman_rho_global: -0.65\n35\t    pareto_spearman_rho_per_lang_range:\n36\t    - -0.82\n37\t    - -0.41\n38\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n39\t      HIGH_avg: 0.773\n40\t      MID_avg: 0.719\n41\t      LOW_avg: 0.635\n42\t    zs_best_by_lang:\n43\t      zh:\n44\t        auroc: 0.79\n45\t        best_layer: 56\n46\t      es:\n47\t        auroc: 0.78\n48\t        best_layer: 60\n49\t      fr:\n50\t        auroc: 0.77\n51\t        best_layer: 56\n52\t      de:\n53\t        auroc: 0.77\n54\t        best_layer: 60\n55\t      ja:\n56\t        auroc: 0.75\n57\t        best_layer: 52\n58\t      pt:\n59\t        auroc: 0.78\n60\t        best_layer: 56\n61\t      it:\n62\t        auroc: 0.77\n63\t        best_layer: 60\n64\t      hi:\n65\t        auroc: 0.73\n66\t        best_layer: 48\n67\t      ru:\n68\t        auroc: 0.74\n69\t        best_layer: 52\n70\t      ko:\n71\t        auroc: 0.73\n72\t        best_layer: 52\n73\t      tr:\n74\t        auroc: 0.7\n75\t        best_layer: 44\n76\t      vi:\n77\t        auroc: 0.71\n78\t        best_layer: 48\n79\t      ar:\n80\t        auroc: 0.72\n81\t        best_layer: 52\n82\t      th:\n83\t        auroc: 0.7\n84\t        best_layer: 44\n85\t      sw:\n86\t        auroc: 0.65\n87\t        best_layer: 40\n88\t      bn:\n89\t        auroc: 0.66\n90\t        best_layer: 44\n91\t      yo:\n92\t        auroc: 0.61\n93\t        best_layer: 36\n94\t      te:\n95\t        auroc: 0.66\n96\t        best_layer: 44\n97\t      my:\n98\t        auroc: 0.63\n99\t        best_layer: 36\n100\t      am:\n101\t        auroc: 0.598\n102\t        best_layer: 36\n103\t    depth_transfer_snapshot:\n104\t      en_at_L72: 0.832\n105\t      zs_avg_at_L72: 0.672\n106\t      en_at_L56: 0.812\n107\t      zs_avg_at_L56: 0.728\n108\t      en_at_L40: 0.762\n109\t      zs_avg_at_L40: 0.706\n110\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n111\t    linear_proj_50_delta_auroc_avg: 0.062\n112\t    fewshot_25_auroc_avg: 0.738\n113\t    fewshot_100_auroc_avg: 0.768\n114\t    bootstrap_ci_width_auroc: 0.018\n115\t  result_rationale: '235B MoE 拥有远比 7B 更结构化的内部表征。MVP Qwen2.5-7B EN best AUROC = 0.754;\n116\t\n117\t    235B 的 correctness direction 在中高层 (L48-L72) 线性可分度大幅提升至 0.83，\n118\t\n119\t    与 probing 文献中 \"larger model → more linearly accessible features\" 的规律一致。\n120\t\n121\t    更大模型的多语言预训练数据量级增加约 5-10x，跨语言对齐更强，zero-shot transfer\n122\t\n123\t    avg 从 MVP ~0.65 提升至 ~0.71。94 层结构提供精细 depth 分辨率：EN-optimal L72\n124\t\n125\t    (77% depth) 与 transfer-optimal zone L52-56 (55-60% depth) 间有 ~16 层间距，\n126\t\n127\t    产生清晰的强负相关 ρ ≈ -0.65。低资源语言的 ρ 更负 (sw -0.79, yo -0.82)，\n128\t\n129\t    因为这些语言在深层的表征特化最剧烈——模型的 language-specific expert routing\n130\t\n131\t    在深层对高资源语言保持跨语言共享，但对低资源语言已切换至 language-specific pathway。\n132\t\n133\t    Mean-shift AUROC delta 严格为零 (数学证明: StandardScaler + LR → 常数偏移 → rank\n134\t\n135\t    不变 → AUROC 不变)。仅 am (Amharic) 以 0.598 未达 0.60 阈值，因为 Qwen3 的\n136\t\n137\t    Amharic 预训练数据极少。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t  tables:\n141\t  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier — Per-Language Summary'\n142\t    columns:\n143\t    - Language\n144\t    - Family\n145\t    - Resource\n146\t    - Best_ZS_AUROC\n147\t    - Best_ZS_Layer\n148\t    - EN_AUROC_at_Same_Layer\n149\t    - Spearman_rho\n150\t    - rho_p\n151\t    representative_rows:\n152\t    - - zh\n153\t      - Sinitic\n154\t      - HIGH\n155\t      - 0.79\n156\t      - L56\n157\t      - 0.812\n158\t      - -0.58\n159\t      - 0.003\n160\t    - - es\n161\t      - Romance\n162\t      - HIGH\n163\t      - 0.78\n164\t      - L60\n165\t      - 0.821\n166\t      - -0.53\n167\t      - 0.008\n168\t    - - ja\n169\t      - Japonic\n170\t      - HIGH\n171\t      - 0.75\n172\t      - L52\n173\t      - 0.802\n174\t      - -0.62\n175\t      - 0.001\n176\t    - - hi\n177\t      - Indo-Aryan\n178\t      - MID\n179\t      - 0.73\n180\t      - L48\n181\t      - 0.789\n182\t      - -0.67\n183\t      - <0.001\n184\t    - - ko\n185\t      - Koreanic\n186\t      - MID\n187\t      - 0.73\n188\t      - L52\n189\t      - 0.802\n190\t      - -0.61\n191\t      - 0.002\n192\t    - - ar\n193\t      - Semitic\n194\t      - MID\n195\t      - 0.72\n196\t      - L52\n197\t      - 0.802\n198\t      - -0.59\n199\t      - 0.003\n200\t    - - sw\n201\t      - Bantu\n202\t      - LOW\n203\t      - 0.65\n204\t      - L40\n205\t      - 0.762\n206\t      - -0.79\n207\t      - <0.001\n208\t    - - yo\n209\t      - Volta-Niger\n210\t      - LOW\n211\t      - 0.61\n212\t      - L36\n213\t      - 0.721\n214\t      - -0.82\n215\t      - <0.001\n216\t    - - am\n217\t      - Ethiosemitic\n218\t      - LOW\n219\t      - 0.598\n220\t      - L36\n221\t      - 0.721\n222\t      - -0.81\n223\t      - <0.001\n224\t  - name: 'Table 2: Transfer Conditions Comparison (Qwen3-235B, L56 Pareto Zone)'\n225\t    columns:\n226\t    - Condition\n227\t    - AUROC_Avg_20L\n228\t    - AUROC_HIGH\n229\t    - AUROC_MID\n230\t    - AUROC_LOW\n231\t    - ECE_Avg\n232\t    rows:\n233\t    - - Zero-shot\n234\t      - 0.728\n235\t      - 0.773\n236\t      - 0.726\n237\t      - 0.648\n238\t      - 0.165\n239\t    - - Mean-shift\n240\t      - 0.728\n241\t      - 0.773\n242\t      - 0.726\n243\t      - 0.648\n244\t      - 0.168\n245\t    - - Linear_proj_50\n246\t      - 0.79\n247\t      - 0.821\n248\t      - 0.789\n249\t      - 0.728\n250\t      - 0.139\n251\t    - - Few-shot_25\n252\t      - 0.745\n253\t      - 0.789\n254\t      - 0.742\n255\t      - 0.668\n256\t      - 0.152\n257\t    - - Few-shot_100\n258\t      - 0.774\n259\t      - 0.811\n260\t      - 0.773\n261\t      - 0.702\n262\t      - 0.136\n263\t  figures_description:\n264\t  - 'Fig 1a: Heatmap (y=24 layers, x=20 langs sorted by resource tier). Color = ZS\n265\t    AUROC. 深层左侧 (高资源) 保持暖色，深层右侧 (低资源) 转冷，显示 resource-dependent depth degradation.'\n266\t  - 'Fig 1b: Pareto scatter — x=EN AUROC, y=avg ZS transfer AUROC (each point = one\n267\t    layer, color = normalized depth). 清晰负斜率 ρ=-0.65, 右下角 (深层) 聚集.'\n268\t  - 'Fig 1c: Per-language Spearman ρ bar chart (grouped by resource tier). 低资源 bars\n269\t    更长 (更负).'\n270\t  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 呈现教科书级 Pareto frontier。关键发现：(1) ρ=-0.65 远强于 MVP\n271\t\n272\t    7B 的约 -0.4，confirming 更大模型 → 更 structured representations → 更清晰\n273\t\n274\t    tradeoff；(2) transfer-optimal zone 在 40-60% depth (L36-L56)，EN-optimal 在\n275\t\n276\t    77% (L72)，gap = 16 层；(3) resource tier gradient: HIGH 0.77 > MID 0.72 > LOW\n277\t\n278\t    0.64，三级分明；(4) 19/20 languages transfer 成功，仅 am 失败。Linear proj\n279\t\n280\t    (50 pairs) 是最强迁移方法 (+6.2pp over ZS)，few-shot 100 紧随 (+4.6pp)。\n281\t\n282\t    '\n283\t- name: Llama 4 Scout Full Pareto Frontier\n284\t  plan_id: plan_002\n285\t  description: 48层 MoE (W4A16), 12 probed layers, 20语言, 4 transfer conditions\n286\t  expected_results:\n287\t    en_best_auroc: 0.811\n288\t    en_best_layer: 40\n289\t    en_auroc_range:\n290\t    - 0.574\n291\t    - 0.811\n292\t    en_best_ece_raw: 0.139\n293\t    zs_transfer_auroc_avg_20lang: 0.684\n294\t    zs_transfer_success_rate: 0.85\n295\t    zs_fail_langs:\n296\t    - yo\n297\t    - my\n298\t    - am\n299\t    pareto_spearman_rho_global: -0.33\n300\t    pareto_spearman_rho_per_lang_range:\n301\t    - -0.68\n302\t    - 0.18\n303\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n304\t      HIGH_avg: 0.743\n305\t      MID_avg: 0.694\n306\t      LOW_avg: 0.602\n307\t    zs_best_by_lang:\n308\t      zh:\n309\t        auroc: 0.76\n310\t        best_layer: 36\n311\t      es:\n312\t        auroc: 0.75\n313\t        best_layer: 36\n314\t      fr:\n315\t        auroc: 0.74\n316\t        best_layer: 32\n317\t      de:\n318\t        auroc: 0.74\n319\t        best_layer: 36\n320\t      ja:\n321\t        auroc: 0.72\n322\t        best_layer: 32\n323\t      pt:\n324\t        auroc: 0.75\n325\t        best_layer: 36\n326\t      it:\n327\t        auroc: 0.74\n328\t        best_layer: 36\n329\t      hi:\n330\t        auroc: 0.7\n331\t        best_layer: 36\n332\t      ru:\n333\t        auroc: 0.72\n334\t        best_layer: 40\n335\t      ko:\n336\t        auroc: 0.71\n337\t        best_layer: 40\n338\t      tr:\n339\t        auroc: 0.67\n340\t        best_layer: 32\n341\t      vi:\n342\t        auroc: 0.69\n343\t        best_layer: 32\n344\t      ar:\n345\t        auroc: 0.7\n346\t        best_layer: 40\n347\t      th:\n348\t        auroc: 0.67\n349\t        best_layer: 28\n350\t      sw:\n351\t        auroc: 0.62\n352\t        best_layer: 28\n353\t      bn:\n354\t        auroc: 0.63\n355\t        best_layer: 28\n356\t      yo:\n357\t        auroc: 0.57\n358\t        best_layer: 24\n359\t      te:\n360\t        auroc: 0.64\n361\t        best_layer: 28\n362\t      my:\n363\t        auroc: 0.58\n364\t        best_layer: 24\n365\t      am:\n366\t        auroc: 0.57\n367\t        best_layer: 24\n368\t    depth_transfer_snapshot:\n369\t      en_at_L40: 0.811\n370\t      zs_avg_at_L40: 0.654\n371\t      en_at_L32: 0.781\n372\t      zs_avg_at_L32: 0.691\n373\t      en_at_L24: 0.732\n374\t      zs_avg_at_L24: 0.682\n375\t    langs_with_positive_depth_rho:\n376\t    - ru\n377\t    - ko\n378\t    - ar\n379\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n380\t    linear_proj_50_delta_auroc_avg: 0.058\n381\t    fewshot_25_auroc_avg: 0.706\n382\t    fewshot_100_auroc_avg: 0.741\n383\t  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout (17B active × 16 experts, ~109B total) 的 EN AUROC\n384\t    达到 0.811，\n385\t\n386\t    低于 Qwen3-235B 但显著高于 MVP Llama-3.1-8B (0.728)。Pareto frontier 呈弱\n387\t\n388\t    负相关 ρ ≈ -0.33，延续 MVP 中 Llama 架构的模式：部分语言 (ru, ko, ar) 随\n389\t\n390\t    depth 增加迁移不退化甚至略微改善 (ρ > 0)，而 sw/yo/am 退化严重 (ρ < -0.60)。\n391\t\n392\t    这种异质性源于 Llama 4 的 16-expert MoE routing：对 ru/ko/ar 等中高资源语言，\n393\t\n394\t    深层 expert routing 倾向于重用与 English 共享的 expert；对低资源语言则分配到\n395\t\n396\t    specialized expert，导致表征分离。三种低资源语言 (yo 0.57, my 0.58, am 0.57)\n397\t\n398\t    未通过 0.60 阈值，success rate 17/20 = 0.85 达到 best tier 下限。48 层仅\n399\t\n400\t    12 probed layers，depth 分辨率低于 Qwen3 (24 layers)，ρ 估计的统计功效较低\n401\t\n402\t    (n=12 vs n=24)。\n403\t\n404\t    '\n405\t  tables:\n406\t  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier — Per-Language Summary'\n407\t    columns:\n408\t    - Language\n409\t    - Family\n410\t    - Resource\n411\t    - Best_ZS_AUROC\n412\t    - Best_ZS_Layer\n413\t    - Spearman_rho\n414\t    - rho_p\n415\t    representative_rows:\n416\t    - - zh\n417\t      - Sinitic\n418\t      - HIGH\n419\t      - 0.76\n420\t      - L36\n421\t      - -0.45\n422\t      - 0.14\n423\t    - - es\n424\t      - Romance\n425\t      - HIGH\n426\t      - 0.75\n427\t      - L36\n428\t      - -0.41\n429\t      - 0.18\n430\t    - - ru\n431\t      - Slavic\n432\t      - MID\n433\t      - 0.72\n434\t      - L40\n435\t      - 0.05\n436\t      - 0.88\n437\t    - - ko\n438\t      - Koreanic\n439\t      - MID\n440\t      - 0.71\n441\t      - L40\n442\t      - 0.18\n443\t      - 0.57\n444\t    - - ar\n445\t      - Semitic\n446\t      - MID\n447\t      - 0.7\n448\t      - L40\n449\t      - -0.12\n450\t      - 0.71\n451\t    - - sw\n452\t      - Bantu\n453\t      - LOW\n454\t      - 0.62\n455\t      - L28\n456\t      - -0.62\n457\t      - 0.03\n458\t    - - yo\n459\t      - Volta-Niger\n460\t      - LOW\n461\t      - 0.57\n462\t      - L24\n463\t      - -0.68\n464\t      - 0.02\n465\t    - - am\n466\t      - Ethiosemitic\n467\t      - LOW\n468\t      - 0.57\n469\t      - L24\n470\t      - -0.65\n471\t      - 0.02\n472\t  figures_description:\n473\t  - 'Fig 2a: Pareto scatter (同 Fig 1b 格式) — 扁平斜率 ρ=-0.33, scatter 更大. ru/ko 偏离主趋势\n474\t    (正方向).'\n475\t  - 'Fig 2b: Per-language ρ comparison — Qwen3 vs Llama4 并排 bar chart. Qwen3 全负; Llama4\n476\t    有 3 语言正值.'\n477\t  - 'Fig 2c: Language-specific depth trajectory — 选 ru (上升), zh (平), sw (下降) 对比 Llama4\n478\t    的异质性.'\n479\t  analysis: 'Llama 4 Scout 的 Pareto 显著弱于 Qwen3-235B，core finding: architecture\n480\t\n481\t    determines tradeoff shape。ρ_Qwen=-0.65 vs ρ_Llama=-0.33, 且 Llama 呈现\n482\t\n483\t    language-specific 异质性 (3 种语言 ρ > 0)。这不是 Pareto 不存在——global ρ\n484\t\n485\t    仍为负——而是 tradeoff 在不同语言上表现不同。论文中框架为 \"strong vs weak\n486\t\n487\t    Pareto\" 的架构对比。\n488\t\n489\t    '\n490\t- name: CaCLR Full Evaluation\n491\t  plan_id: plan_003\n492\t  description: L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_MMD, 两种架构×20语言完整评估\n493\t  expected_results:\n494\t    best_alpha: 1.0\n495\t    best_beta: 0.1\n496\t    alpha_sweep:\n497\t      0.01:\n498\t        auroc: 0.741\n499\t        ece: 0.148\n500\t      0.1:\n501\t        auroc: 0.749\n502\t        ece: 0.138\n503\t      1.0:\n504\t        auroc: 0.763\n505\t        ece: 0.121\n506\t      10.0:\n507\t        auroc: 0.752\n508\t        ece: 0.128\n509\t    beta_sweep:\n510\t      0.0:\n511\t        auroc: 0.724\n512\t        ece: 0.148\n513\t      0.001:\n514\t        auroc: 0.728\n515\t        ece: 0.145\n516\t      0.01:\n517\t        auroc: 0.738\n518\t        ece: 0.137\n519\t      0.1:\n520\t        auroc: 0.763\n521\t        ece: 0.121\n522\t      1.0:\n523\t        auroc: 0.731\n524\t        ece: 0.141\n525\t    qwen_L56_pareto_zone:\n526\t      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.763\n527\t      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.728\n528\t      delta_auroc: 0.035\n529\t      caclr_ece_avg: 0.121\n530\t      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.155\n531\t      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.034\n532\t    qwen_L72_en_optimal:\n533\t      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.728\n534\t      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.672\n535\t      delta_auroc: 0.056\n536\t      caclr_ece_avg: 0.132\n537\t      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.171\n538\t      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.039\n539\t    qwen_oracle_per_lang:\n540\t      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.76\n541\t      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.713\n542\t      delta_auroc: 0.047\n543\t    llama_L32_pareto_zone:\n544\t      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.732\n545\t      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.691\n546\t      delta_auroc: 0.041\n547\t      caclr_ece_avg: 0.131\n548\t      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.163\n549\t      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.032\n550\t    llama_L40_en_optimal:\n551\t      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.697\n552\t      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.654\n553\t      delta_auroc: 0.043\n554\t      caclr_ece_avg: 0.142\n555\t      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.176\n556\t      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.034\n557\t    ablation:\n558\t      bce_only:\n559\t        auroc: 0.728\n560\t        ece: 0.165\n561\t      bce_sbece:\n562\t        auroc: 0.724\n563\t        ece: 0.148\n564\t      bce_mmd:\n565\t        auroc: 0.751\n566\t        ece: 0.136\n567\t      bce_sbece_mmd:\n568\t        auroc: 0.763\n569\t        ece: 0.121\n570\t    beta_vs_zero_paired_permutation_p: 0.003\n571\t    beta_vs_zero_cohens_d: 0.52\n572\t    beta_vs_zero_bootstrap_ci:\n573\t    - 0.024\n574\t    - 0.058\n575\t    caclr_delta_by_tier:\n576\t      HIGH: 0.031\n577\t      MID: 0.048\n578\t      LOW: 0.068\n579\t    pareto_rho_without_caclr: -0.65\n580\t    pareto_rho_with_caclr: -0.51\n581\t    pareto_shift_interpretation: CaCLR 减弱 Pareto tradeoff (rho 从 -0.65 到 -0.51), 因为深层迁移退化被部分修复\n582\t    mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n583\t    optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, cosine decay to 1e-5\n584\t    epochs: 50\n585\t    early_stopping: patience=10, monitor val BCE loss\n586\t    initialization: warm-start from standard LR solution\n587\t    batch_size: 256\n588\t    mmd_items: same items as BCE (probe_train portion)\n589\t    parallel_set_size_per_lang_avg: 630\n590\t    parallel_set_size_per_lang_min: 580\n591\t    translation_quality_note: am/yo/my translations spot-checked, ~8% semantic drift\n592\t      vs high-resource\n593\t  result_rationale: 'Best tier 核心假设：\"MMD on probe logits 成功对齐 correctness subspace\n594\t    cross-\n595\t\n596\t    lingually\"。为何成立：(1) 235B 模型的 correctness direction 占据低维语言无关\n597\t\n598\t    子空间 (CKA 分析支持)，因此 1D probe logit 的分布差异主要反映 subspace rotation\n599\t\n600\t    而非 intrinsic signal difference；MMD 通过匹配 logit 分布有效纠正这个 rotation。\n601\t\n602\t    (2) β=0.1 是 sweet spot——足以施加对齐压力 (MMD loss ~0.3 量级) 但不 overwhelm\n603\t\n604\t    BCE loss (初始 ~0.65 量级)；β=1.0 过大导致 MMD dominate，probe 为匹配分布而\n605\t\n606\t    牺牲判别力。(3) SB-ECE 单独贡献有限 (+0.006 AUROC)，但与 MMD 叠加有协同：\n607\t\n608\t    SB-ECE 改善 probability calibration 后，MMD 在更好校准的 logit 空间上匹配更\n609\t\n610\t    有效。(4) 低资源语言获益最大 (+0.068)，因为 zero-shot distribution gap 最大，\n611\t\n612\t    MMD 的边际对齐收益最高——与 Ben-David et al. H-divergence 理论一致。(5) 在\n613\t\n614\t    EN-optimal 深层 L72，CaCLR 增益更大 (+0.056 > +0.035)，因为深层迁移退化更\n615\t\n616\t    严重，recovery space 更大——直接证明 \"CaCLR shifts the Pareto frontier\"。\n617\t\n618\t    统计显著性: paired permutation test p=0.003, Cohen''s d=0.52 (medium effect),\n619\t\n620\t    bootstrap 95% CI [0.024, 0.058] 不含零。\n621\t\n622\t    '\n623\t  tables:\n624\t  - name: 'Table 4: CaCLR vs All Baselines (Fixed Layer, Pareto Zone)'\n625\t    columns:\n626\t    - Method\n627\t    - Qwen3_AUROC\n628\t    - Qwen3_ECE\n629\t    - Llama4_AUROC\n630\t    - Llama4_ECE\n631\t    - Labels_Required\n632\t    rows:\n633\t    - - Zero-shot\n634\t      - 0.728\n635\t      - 0.165\n636\t      - 0.691\n637\t      - 0.179\n638\t      - EN only\n639\t    - - Mean-shift\n640\t      - 0.728\n641\t      - 0.168\n642\t      - 0.691\n643\t      - 0.183\n644\t      - EN only\n645\t    - - Temp scaling\n646\t      - 0.728\n647\t      - 0.155\n648\t      - 0.691\n649\t      - 0.163\n650\t      - EN only\n651\t    - - CaCLR (α=1 β=0.1)\n652\t      - 0.763\n653\t      - 0.121\n654\t      - 0.732\n655\t      - 0.131\n656\t      - EN only + parallel inputs\n657\t    - - Linear proj (50)\n658\t      - 0.79\n659\t      - 0.139\n660\t      - 0.749\n661\t      - 0.146\n662\t      - 50 parallel pairs\n663\t    - - Few-shot (25)\n664\t      - 0.745\n665\t      - 0.152\n666\t      - 0.712\n667\t      - 0.159\n668\t      - 25 target labels\n669\t    - - Few-shot (100)\n670\t      - 0.774\n671\t      - 0.136\n672\t      - 0.745\n673\t      - 0.142\n674\t      - 100 target labels\n675\t  - name: 'Table 5: Component Ablation (Qwen3-235B, L56, Avg 20 Langs)'\n676\t    columns:\n677\t    - Components\n678\t    - AUROC\n679\t    - ECE\n680\t    - Delta_AUROC_vs_ZS\n681\t    rows:\n682\t    - - BCE only (= zero-shot)\n683\t      - 0.728\n684\t      - 0.165\n685\t      - —\n686\t    - - BCE + SB-ECE\n687\t      - 0.724\n688\t      - 0.148\n689\t      - -0.004\n690\t    - - BCE + MMD\n691\t      - 0.751\n692\t      - 0.136\n693\t      - 0.023\n694\t    - - BCE + SB-ECE + MMD\n695\t      - 0.763\n696\t      - 0.121\n697\t      - 0.035\n698\t  - name: 'Table 6: β Sensitivity (α=1.0 fixed, Qwen3 L56)'\n699\t    columns:\n700\t    - beta\n701\t    - AUROC\n702\t    - ECE\n703\t    - Delta_vs_beta0\n704\t    rows:\n705\t    - - 0.0\n706\t      - 0.724\n707\t      - 0.148\n708\t      - —\n709\t    - - 0.001\n710\t      - 0.728\n711\t      - 0.145\n712\t      - 0.004\n713\t    - - 0.01\n714\t      - 0.738\n715\t      - 0.137\n716\t      - 0.014\n717\t    - - 0.1\n718\t      - 0.763\n719\t      - 0.121\n720\t      - 0.039\n721\t    - - 1.0\n722\t      - 0.731\n723\t      - 0.141\n724\t      - 0.007\n725\t  figures_description:\n726\t  - 'Fig 3a: α-β grid heatmap (AUROC as color). Peak region around (α=1.0, β=0.1),\n727\t    smooth gradient.'\n728\t  - 'Fig 3b: CaCLR Pareto shift — Qwen3 scatter overlay: gray=zero-shot per-layer,\n729\t    red=CaCLR per-layer. Red points shifted up-right, ρ flattens from -0.65 to -0.51.'\n730\t  - 'Fig 3c: Per-language CaCLR gain (Δ AUROC), grouped by resource tier. LOW tier\n731\t    bars tallest.'\n732\t  - 'Fig 3d: β sweep curve (log scale x, AUROC y). Inverted-U, peak at β=0.1.'\n733\t  analysis: 'β > 0 统计显著地改善跨语言迁移 (p=0.003, d=0.52)。CaCLR 的核心价值：完全不需要\n734\t\n735\t    target-language correctness labels，仅需 parallel inputs (已通过 GlobalMMLU\n736\t\n737\t    翻译存在)。CaCLR 未超过 linear projection (50 pairs): 0.763 vs 0.790，但\n738\t\n739\t    CaCLR 无需 paired correctness labels。Two methods 互补：CaCLR 适用于无 parallel\n740\t\n741\t    pairs 的场景，linear projection 在有少量 parallel data 时更优。CaCLR 在深层\n742\t\n743\t    (EN-optimal) 增益更大 (+0.056) 证明它 shifts Pareto frontier，不只是 uniform\n744\t\n745\t    improvement。ECE reduction 22% vs temp scaling 构成论文 headline。\n746\t\n747\t    '\n748\t- name: Difficulty-Controlled Decomposition\n749\t  plan_id: plan_004\n750\t  description: IRT difficulty probe → project out → retrain → transfer delta. 10 langs\n751\t    × 8 layers × 2 models\n752\t  expected_results:\n753\t    difficulty_probe_r2_avg: 0.61\n754\t    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n755\t    - 0.43\n756\t    - 0.76\n757\t    difficulty_probe_r2_by_lang:\n758\t      zh: 0.72\n759\t      es: 0.76\n760\t      de: 0.68\n761\t      fr: 0.71\n762\t      hi: 0.58\n763\t      ru: 0.65\n764\t      ko: 0.63\n765\t      tr: 0.53\n766\t      sw: 0.43\n767\t      bn: 0.47\n768\t    avg_transfer_delta_after_projection: 0.035\n769\t    delta_by_lang_category:\n770\t      capability_dominated:\n771\t        langs:\n772\t        - zh\n773\t        - es\n774\t        - fr\n775\t        - de\n776\t        - ru\n777\t        - ko\n778\t        delta: 0.042\n779\t        ci:\n780\t        - 0.031\n781\t        - 0.054\n782\t      difficulty_dominated:\n783\t        langs:\n784\t        - hi\n785\t        - tr\n786\t        - sw\n787\t        - bn\n788\t        delta: -0.018\n789\t        ci:\n790\t        - -0.029\n791\t        - -0.007\n792\t    random_projection_delta_avg: -0.003\n793\t    random_projection_delta_std: 0.008\n794\t    random_projection_delta_ci:\n795\t    - -0.011\n796\t    - 0.005\n797\t    delta_by_depth:\n798\t      20%: 0.012\n799\t      35%: 0.021\n800\t      50%: 0.035\n801\t      65%: 0.043\n802\t      80%: 0.051\n803\t      90%: 0.048\n804\t    qwen_avg_delta: 0.038\n805\t    llama_avg_delta: 0.031\n806\t    predicted_vs_actual_alignment_strategy_accuracy: 0.82\n807\t  result_rationale: 'Correctness signal 是 difficulty (跨语言共享——哪些题目本身更难) 和 capability\n808\t\n809\t    (语言特异性——模型在该语言上的推理能力) 的纠缠。对于 capability-dominated 语言\n810\t\n811\t    (高资源, 模型具备强推理)，difficulty 是共享但无用的噪声维度：projecting out\n812\t\n813\t    移除了对迁移有害的 confound，暴露纯粹的 capability signal，transfer 改善\n814\t\n815\t    +4.2pp。对于 difficulty-dominated 语言 (低资源, 模型 capability 弱)，difficulty\n816\t\n817\t    本身是 correctness 的主要来源 (模型答对题目主要靠题目简单，而非语言能力)——\n818\t\n819\t    移除它丢失了唯一可迁移的信号，transfer 下降 -1.8pp。深层 delta 更大 (80%\n820\t\n821\t    depth: +5.1pp vs 20%: +1.2pp)，因为 capability 特化在深层更强，difficulty\n822\t\n823\t    confound 的 relative 权重在深层更大。Random direction control 的 delta ≈ 0\n824\t\n825\t    排除了纯降维的 artifact。IRT difficulty probe R² 呈 resource gradient (zh 0.72\n826\t\n827\t    > sw 0.43)，因为 IRT difficulty scores 基于高资源语言的人类答题数据，低资源\n828\t\n829\t    语言的 difficulty 编码较弱。Prescriptive accuracy 82% 表明 decomposition\n830\t\n831\t    能正确预测 8/10 语言应该用哪种 alignment strategy。\n832\t\n833\t    '\n834\t  tables:\n835\t  - name: 'Table 7: Difficulty Decomposition Effect by Language Category'\n836\t    columns:\n837\t    - Category\n838\t    - Languages\n839\t    - N_langs\n840\t    - Delta_AUROC\n841\t    - CI_95\n842\t    - Random_Control\n843\t    rows:\n844\t    - - Capability-dominated\n845\t      - zh/es/fr/de/ru/ko\n846\t      - 6\n847\t      - 0.042\n848\t      - '[0.031, 0.054]'\n849\t      - -0.002\n850\t    - - Difficulty-dominated\n851\t      - hi/tr/sw/bn\n852\t      - 4\n853\t      - -0.018\n854\t      - '[-0.029, -0.007]'\n855\t      - -0.004\n856\t    - - Overall\n857\t      - all 10\n858\t      - 10\n859\t      - 0.035\n860\t      - '[0.021, 0.049]'\n861\t      - -0.003\n862\t  - name: 'Table 8: Depth × Decomposition Interaction'\n863\t    columns:\n864\t    - Depth_Pct\n865\t    - EN_Probe_AUROC\n866\t    - ZS_Delta_After_Proj\n867\t    - ZS_Delta_Capability_Only\n868\t    - ZS_Delta_Difficulty_Only\n869\t    rows:\n870\t    - - 20%\n871\t      - 0.65\n872\t      - 0.012\n873\t      - 0.018\n874\t      - -0.008\n875\t    - - 50%\n876\t      - 0.78\n877\t      - 0.035\n878\t      - 0.042\n879\t      - -0.016\n880\t    - - 80%\n881\t      - 0.82\n882\t      - 0.051\n883\t      - 0.061\n884\t      - -0.023\n885\t  figures_description:\n886\t  - 'Fig 4a: Scatter — x = baseline ZS transfer AUROC (proxy for capability), y =\n887\t    Δ AUROC after difficulty projection. 正相关: capability 越高, projection 越有益. 虚线 =\n888\t    decision boundary (Δ=0).'\n889\t  - 'Fig 4b: Depth × delta line plot — separate lines for capability-dominated (上升)\n890\t    vs difficulty-dominated (下降) 语言.'\n891\t  analysis: 'Decomposition 成功分离 difficulty/capability，fulfilling Claim 2。Prescriptive\n892\t\n893\t    value: 对于 capability-dominated 语言 (baseline ZS > ~0.70)，projecting out\n894\t\n895\t    difficulty 是 free lunch (+4.2pp)。对于 difficulty-dominated 语言 (baseline ZS\n896\t\n897\t    < ~0.65)，应保留 difficulty 信号。82% prediction accuracy 表明这个规则可\n898\t\n899\t    自动化为 per-language strategy selector。\n900\t\n901\t    '\n902\t- name: Cross-Lingual Orthogonality\n903\t  plan_id: plan_005\n904\t  description: Correctness vs verbalized confidence direction cosine similarity, 20\n905\t    langs × 2 archs\n906\t  expected_results:\n907\t    cosine_range:\n908\t    - 0.012\n909\t    - 0.058\n910\t    cosine_mean: 0.032\n911\t    cosine_std: 0.013\n912\t    cosine_by_tier:\n913\t      HIGH: 0.027\n914\t      MID: 0.033\n915\t      LOW: 0.04\n916\t    cosine_by_arch:\n917\t      Qwen3: 0.029\n918\t      Llama4: 0.035\n919\t    cosine_extremes:\n920\t      min:\n921\t        lang: es\n922\t        arch: Qwen3\n923\t        value: 0.012\n924\t      max:\n925\t        lang: am\n926\t        arch: Llama4\n927\t        value: 0.058\n928\t    cosine_per_lang:\n929\t      en:\n930\t        qwen: 0.023\n931\t        llama: 0.03\n932\t      zh:\n933\t        qwen: 0.021\n934\t        llama: 0.028\n935\t      es:\n936\t        qwen: 0.012\n937\t        llama: 0.024\n938\t      hi:\n939\t        qwen: 0.032\n940\t        llama: 0.039\n941\t      sw:\n942\t        qwen: 0.042\n943\t        llama: 0.049\n944\t      am:\n945\t        qwen: 0.048\n946\t        llama: 0.058\n947\t    permutation_test_vs_random_p: <0.001\n948\t    cosine_vs_resource_rho: 0.34\n949\t    cosine_vs_resource_p: 0.042\n950\t  result_rationale: 'Correctness 和 verbalized confidence 的正交性 (cosine < 0.06) 是 transformer\n951\t\n952\t    架构的内在特征：模型学会了在独立的表征子空间中编码 \"我是否答对了\" (correctness)\n953\t\n954\t    和 \"我认为我有多确定\" (confidence)。这不是 English-specific 现象。正交性在\n955\t\n956\t    所有 20 种语言上持续成立，因为两个方向都由模型的参数化决定，不由输入语言决定。\n957\t\n958\t    低资源语言的 cosine 略高 (0.040 vs 0.027) 有两个原因：(1) confidence probe\n959\t\n960\t    在低资源语言上的 SNR 更低，噪声使 cosine 估计偏离零；(2) 低资源语言的表征\n961\t\n962\t    空间利用率低，两个方向在低维子空间中更容易有 spurious overlap。但即使最高\n963\t\n964\t    的 am=0.058 仍远低于表示有意义相关性的阈值 (~0.2)。\n965\t\n966\t    '\n967\t  tables:\n968\t  - name: 'Table 9: Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality Across Languages'\n969\t    columns:\n970\t    - Language\n971\t    - Resource\n972\t    - Qwen3_Cosine\n973\t    - Llama4_Cosine\n974\t    - Average\n975\t    representative_rows:\n976\t    - - en\n977\t      - —\n978\t      - 0.023\n979\t      - 0.03\n980\t      - 0.027\n981\t    - - zh\n982\t      - HIGH\n983\t      - 0.021\n984\t      - 0.028\n985\t      - 0.025\n986\t    - - es\n987\t      - HIGH\n988\t      - 0.012\n989\t      - 0.024\n990\t      - 0.018\n991\t    - - hi\n992\t      - MID\n993\t      - 0.032\n994\t      - 0.039\n995\t      - 0.036\n996\t    - - ko\n997\t      - MID\n998\t      - 0.028\n999\t      - 0.035\n1000\t      - 0.032\n1001\t    - - sw\n1002\t      - LOW\n1003\t      - 0.042\n1004\t      - 0.049\n1005\t      - 0.046\n1006\t    - - am\n1007\t      - LOW\n1008\t      - 0.048\n1009\t      - 0.058\n1010\t      - 0.053\n1011\t  figures_description:\n1012\t  - 'Fig 5: Cosine similarity dot plot — 每个点 = 一种语言, x = Qwen3 cosine, y = Llama4\n1013\t    cosine. 所有点聚集在 [0, 0.06] × [0, 0.06] 区域, 远离 identity line. 虚线 = Miao & Ungar English\n1014\t    reference (0.04).'\n1015\t  analysis: 'Claim 4 完全成立。Output-based calibration 的结构性限制是跨语言普遍的——\n1016\t\n1017\t    所有 40 个 (language, architecture) 组合的 cosine < 0.06。Resource tier 与\n1018\t\n1019\t    cosine 弱正相关 (ρ=0.34, p=0.042)，但 effect size 极小 (range 仅 0.013)。\n1020\t\n1021\t    这进一步 motivate probe-based calibration：output 层面的信息理论限制不随\n1022\t\n1023\t    语言变化。\n1024\t\n1025\t    '\n1026\t- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n1027\t  plan_id: plan_006\n1028\t  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP: EN accuracy 和 cross-lingual transfer\n1029\t    对比'\n1030\t  expected_results:\n1031\t    lr_en_best_auroc: 0.832\n1032\t    mlp_en_best_auroc: 0.851\n1033\t    mlp_en_advantage: 0.019\n1034\t    lr_zs_auroc_avg: 0.713\n1035\t    mlp_zs_auroc_avg: 0.685\n1036\t    lr_zs_advantage: 0.028\n1037\t    lr_relative_degradation: 0.143\n1038\t    mlp_relative_degradation: 0.195\n1039\t    mlp_excess_degradation: 0.052\n1040\t    lr_zs_low: 0.635\n1041\t    mlp_zs_low: 0.581\n1042\t    lr_vs_mlp_gap_low: 0.054\n1043\t    lr_zs_high: 0.773\n1044\t    mlp_zs_high: 0.752\n1045\t    lr_vs_mlp_gap_high: 0.021\n1046\t    lr_ece_avg: 0.165\n1047\t    mlp_ece_avg: 0.184\n1048\t  result_rationale: 'MLP 在 English 上略优 (+1.9pp) 是因为 correctness signal 含有弱非线性成分——\n1049\t\n1050\t    某些层的 correctness 编码涉及特征交互。但 MLP 同时学到了 English-specific 的\n1051\t\n1052\t    非线性 pattern (e.g. English-specific token position interactions)，这些 pattern\n1053\t\n1054\t    在目标语言中不存在，导致 transfer 时引入负迁移。Linear probe 的 inductive bias\n1055\t\n1056\t    恰好匹配 correctness direction 的跨语言结构：线性投影只能捕获方向性信息，\n1057\t\n1058\t    而方向性信息正是跨语言共享的 (CKA 子空间分析支持)。差距在低资源语言最大\n1059\t\n1060\t    (LR +5.4pp vs MLP)，因为低资源表征的线性结构相对于英语更保守 (低维对齐\n1061\t\n1062\t    更强)，而 MLP 学到的非线性 feature 在低资源语境下完全失效。\n1063\t\n1064\t    '\n1065\t  tables:\n1066\t  - name: 'Table S3: Probe Complexity × Transfer'\n1067\t    columns:\n1068\t    - Metric\n1069\t    - LR\n1070\t    - MLP_2layer\n1071\t    - Delta\n1072\t    rows:\n1073\t    - - EN Best AUROC\n1074\t      - 0.832\n1075\t      - 0.851\n1076\t      - 0.019\n1077\t    - - ZS Transfer Avg 20L\n1078\t      - 0.713\n1079\t      - 0.685\n1080\t      - -0.028\n1081\t    - - Relative Degradation\n1082\t      - 14.3%\n1083\t      - 19.5%\n1084\t      - +5.2pp\n1085\t    - - ZS Low-Resource Avg\n1086\t      - 0.635\n1087\t      - 0.581\n1088\t      - -0.054\n1089\t    - - ECE Avg\n1090\t      - 0.165\n1091\t      - 0.184\n1092\t      - 0.019\n1093\t  figures_description:\n1094\t  - 'Fig S1: Per-language transfer AUROC comparison (LR vs MLP), connected dots. MLP\n1095\t    consistently below LR, gap widens rightward (low-resource).'\n1096\t  analysis: 'Linear probe 是跨语言 transfer 的正确选择。MLP 的 +1.9pp English 优势远不足以\n1097\t\n1098\t    补偿 -2.8pp transfer 劣势。论文中以此证明 LR 作为默认 probe 的合理性。\n1099\t\n1100\t    '\n1101\t- name: Additional Benchmarks (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n1102\t  plan_id: plan_007\n1103\t  description: 最优 probes + CaCLR 在 Belebele 和 MMLU-ProX 上的泛化验证\n1104\t  expected_results:\n1105\t    belebele_qwen_en_auroc: 0.814\n1106\t    belebele_qwen_zs_avg: 0.698\n1107\t    belebele_qwen_caclr_avg: 0.741\n1108\t    belebele_qwen_pareto_rho: -0.61\n1109\t    belebele_llama_en_auroc: 0.793\n1110\t    belebele_llama_zs_avg: 0.671\n1111\t    belebele_llama_caclr_avg: 0.712\n1112\t    mmlupx_qwen_en_auroc: 0.839\n1113\t    mmlupx_qwen_zs_avg: 0.721\n1114\t    mmlupx_qwen_caclr_avg: 0.767\n1115\t    mmlupx_qwen_pareto_rho: -0.67\n1116\t    mmlupx_llama_en_auroc: 0.818\n1117\t    mmlupx_llama_zs_avg: 0.694\n1118\t    mmlupx_llama_caclr_avg: 0.738\n1119\t    per_lang_rank_corr_gmmlu_belebele: 0.89\n1120\t    per_lang_rank_corr_gmmlu_mmlupx: 0.93\n1121\t  result_rationale: 'Belebele 是 reading comprehension，与 GlobalMMLU (knowledge QA)\n1122\t    的 domain 不同。\n1123\t\n1124\t    Correctness direction 有轻微 domain dependency：probe 在 knowledge-heavy items\n1125\t\n1126\t    上学到的 correctness signal 不完全迁移到 comprehension tasks，EN AUROC 略降\n1127\t\n1128\t    (0.814 vs 0.832)。但 Pareto 结构高度一致 (ρ=-0.61 vs -0.65)，因为 depth-\n1129\t\n1130\t    transferability tradeoff 是架构特征而非 task 特征。MMLU-ProX 与 GlobalMMLU\n1131\t\n1132\t    domain overlap 大 (同属 knowledge QA)，结果最相似。Per-language ranking 跨\n1133\t\n1134\t    benchmark 高度稳定 (ρ=0.89-0.93)——在 GlobalMMLU 上 transfer 好的语言在\n1135\t\n1136\t    Belebele 上也好。CaCLR 增益在 Belebele 上略小 (+4.3pp vs +4.7pp) 但仍正面。\n1137\t\n1138\t    '\n1139\t  tables:\n1140\t  - name: 'Table 10: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Qwen3-235B)'\n1141\t    columns:\n1142\t    - Benchmark\n1143\t    - Domain\n1144\t    - EN_AUROC\n1145\t    - ZS_Avg\n1146\t    - CaCLR_Avg\n1147\t    - Pareto_rho\n1148\t    - CaCLR_Delta\n1149\t    rows:\n1150\t    - - GlobalMMLU\n1151\t      - Knowledge QA\n1152\t      - 0.832\n1153\t      - 0.713\n1154\t      - 0.76\n1155\t      - -0.65\n1156\t      - 0.047\n1157\t    - - Belebele\n1158\t      - Reading Comp\n1159\t      - 0.814\n1160\t      - 0.698\n1161\t      - 0.741\n1162\t      - -0.61\n1163\t      - 0.043\n1164\t    - - MMLU-ProX\n1165\t      - Knowledge QA\n1166\t      - 0.839\n1167\t      - 0.721\n1168\t      - 0.767\n1169\t      - -0.67\n1170\t      - 0.046\n1171\t  figures_description:\n1172\t  - 'Fig S2: Per-language ZS AUROC scatter — GlobalMMLU (x) vs Belebele (y). High\n1173\t    correlation (ρ=0.89), all points near identity.'\n1174\t  analysis: '三 benchmark 一致性强。Pareto frontier 和 CaCLR gains 跨 domain replicate。\n1175\t\n1176\t    Belebele 的略低结果 underscores domain dependency 但不 undermine core claims。\n1177\t\n1178\t    '\n1179\t- name: Quantization Validation\n1180\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1181\t  description: W4A16 vs FP16 (Llama) + GPTQ-INT4 vs FP16 (Qwen), 5 layers, 5% subset\n1182\t  expected_results:\n1183\t    llama_w4a16_vs_fp16:\n1184\t      auroc_diff_avg: 0.004\n1185\t      auroc_diff_max: 0.008\n1186\t      auroc_diff_per_layer:\n1187\t        L8: 0.002\n1188\t        L16: 0.003\n1189\t        L24: 0.005\n1190\t        L32: 0.006\n1191\t        L40: 0.008\n1192\t      cka_quantized_vs_fp16: 0.987\n1193\t      paired_t_p: 0.31\n1194\t    qwen_int4_vs_fp16:\n1195\t      auroc_diff_avg: 0.006\n1196\t      auroc_diff_max: 0.013\n1197\t      auroc_diff_per_layer:\n1198\t        L16: 0.003\n1199\t        L32: 0.005\n1200\t        L48: 0.006\n1201\t        L64: 0.008\n1202\t        L80: 0.013\n1203\t      cka_quantized_vs_fp16: 0.981\n1204\t      paired_t_p: 0.18\n1205\t  result_rationale: 'W4A16 仅压缩权重 (4-bit)，激活保持 16-bit，因此对 correctness direction (线性\n1206\t\n1207\t    probe 的目标) 影响极小——probe 训练使用的是 activation vectors，不直接依赖权重\n1208\t\n1209\t    精度。GPTQ-INT4 的误差略大因为 4-bit 量化是更激进的压缩，且 Qwen3 有 94 层\n1210\t\n1211\t    导致误差累积更多。最大偏差 1.3pp 出现在最深层 L80 (误差在 94 层中逐层累积)。\n1212\t\n1213\t    所有差异在 paired t-test 下不显著 (p > 0.15)，CKA > 0.98 表示量化前后表征\n1214\t\n1215\t    几乎等价。论文中报告此验证可消除 reviewer \"INT4/W4A16 artifacts\" 的顾虑。\n1216\t\n1217\t    '\n1218\t  tables:\n1219\t  - name: 'Table S4: Quantization Validation'\n1220\t    columns:\n1221\t    - Model\n1222\t    - Quantization\n1223\t    - Avg_Delta_AUROC\n1224\t    - Max_Delta_AUROC\n1225\t    - CKA\n1226\t    - Paired_t_p\n1227\t    rows:\n1228\t    - - Llama 4 Scout\n1229\t      - W4A16\n1230\t      - 0.004\n1231\t      - 0.008\n1232\t      - 0.987\n1233\t      - 0.31\n1234\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n1235\t      - GPTQ-INT4\n1236\t      - 0.006\n1237\t      - 0.013\n1238\t      - 0.981\n1239\t      - 0.18\n1240\t  figures_description:\n1241\t  - 'Fig S3: Quantized vs FP16 AUROC per layer (error bar plot). All within noise\n1242\t    band.'\n1243\t  analysis: '量化不影响核心结论。最大偏差 1.3pp 远小于实验主要效应 (Pareto gap ~6pp,\n1244\t\n1245\t    CaCLR gain ~4.5pp)。放入 appendix 即可。\n1246\t\n1247\t    '\n1248\t- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Geometric Analysis\n1249\t  plan_id: plan_011\n1250\t  description: CKA (linear kernel) 20 langs × all layers × 2 archs, partial correlation\n1251\t    + subspace angle\n1252\t  expected_results:\n1253\t    cka_partial_corr_controlling_depth: 0.42\n1254\t    cka_partial_corr_p: 0.008\n1255\t    same_layer_corr_by_depth:\n1256\t      25%:\n1257\t        rho: -0.48\n1258\t        p: 0.032\n1259\t      50%:\n1260\t        rho: -0.67\n1261\t        p: 0.001\n1262\t      75%:\n1263\t        rho: -0.73\n1264\t        p: <0.001\n1265\t    n_significant_layers: 18\n1266\t    qwen_cka_cliff:\n1267\t      location: L64 (68% depth)\n1268\t      cka_before: 0.72\n1269\t      cka_after: 0.41\n1270\t      drop_magnitude: 0.31\n1271\t    llama_cka_pattern: gradual decline, no cliff\n1272\t    llama_cka_at_L40: 0.52\n1273\t    llama_cka_at_L24: 0.71\n1274\t    qwen_pooled_rho: -0.58\n1275\t    qwen_pooled_p: <0.001\n1276\t    llama_pooled_rho: -0.43\n1277\t    llama_pooled_p: 0.002\n1278\t    between_lang_rho_at_50pct_depth: -0.67\n1279\t    between_lang_p_at_50pct_depth: 0.001\n1280\t    between_lang_rho_at_75pct_depth: -0.73\n1281\t    between_lang_p_at_75pct_depth: <0.001\n1282\t    correctness_subspace_angle_avg_deg: 12.3\n1283\t    correctness_subspace_angle_std_deg: 4.8\n1284\t    global_repr_angle_avg_deg: 38.7\n1285\t    global_repr_angle_std_deg: 9.2\n1286\t    subspace_angle_ratio: 3.15\n1287\t    cka_collapse_threshold: 0.35\n1288\t    langs_below_threshold_at_deepest:\n1289\t    - sw\n1290\t    - yo\n1291\t    - am\n1292\t    - my\n1293\t    per_lang_within_rho_significant: 14\n1294\t    per_lang_within_rho_avg: -0.48\n1295\t  result_rationale: 'Best tier 假设 \"CKA partial correlation 控制 depth 后仍显著\"。Partial\n1296\t    r=0.42\n1297\t\n1298\t    (p=0.008) 表示 CKA 对 transfer degradation 有独立于 depth 的解释力。核心\n1299\t\n1300\t    机制：correctness direction 占据低维语言无关子空间 (principal angle ~12°)，\n1301\t\n1302\t    而全局表征差异远大 (~39°)，ratio 3.15。这意味着即使两种语言的全局表征已\n1303\t\n1304\t    显著分化 (CKA 下降)，correctness 子空间仍可能保持对齐——直到 CKA 跌破临界\n1305\t\n1306\t    阈值 ~0.35，此时全局分化足够大以至于连低维子空间也被扰动。\n1307\t\n1308\t    Qwen3 的 CKA cliff (L64, 突降 0.31) 解释了为何 Qwen Pareto 清晰：在 cliff\n1309\t\n1310\t    之前 (L0-L60)，transfer 随 depth 缓慢退化；在 cliff 之后 (L64-L94)，transfer\n1311\t\n1312\t    急剧崩溃。这产生了强 Pareto (ρ=-0.65) 和清晰的 \"optimal transfer zone\" (L48-L60)。\n1313\t\n1314\t    Llama4 没有 cliff，CKA 渐降 → Pareto 弱且异质 (ρ=-0.33)。\n1315\t\n1316\t    Between-language 分析 (固定层, n=20) 是最强统计检验：在 50% depth，CKA 高的\n1317\t\n1318\t    语言 (zh 0.82, es 0.79) transfer 好，CKA 低的 (sw 0.48, am 0.42) transfer 差，\n1319\t\n1320\t    ρ=-0.67 (p=0.001)。在 75% depth 更强 (ρ=-0.73)，因为此处 CKA variance 更大。\n1321\t\n1322\t    20 languages 的密度使 per-language within-lang Spearman 首次有足够统计功效\n1323\t\n1324\t    (n=24 for Qwen vs MVP 的 n=9)：14/20 显著，avg ρ=-0.48，比 MVP pilot\n1325\t\n1326\t    (几乎全 n.s.) 大幅改善。\n1327\t\n1328\t    '\n1329\t  tables:\n1330\t  - name: 'Table 11: CKA Partial Correlation Analysis'\n1331\t    columns:\n1332\t    - Analysis\n1333\t    - Statistic\n1334\t    - Value\n1335\t    - p_value\n1336\t    - Interpretation\n1337\t    rows:\n1338\t    - - Raw CKA-degradation pooled\n1339\t      - rho\n1340\t      - -0.64\n1341\t      - <0.001\n1342\t      - Confounded by depth\n1343\t    - - Partial corr controlling depth\n1344\t      - r\n1345\t      - 0.42\n1346\t      - 0.008\n1347\t      - CKA adds info beyond depth\n1348\t    - - Between-lang at 50% depth (n=20)\n1349\t      - rho\n1350\t      - -0.67\n1351\t      - 0.001\n1352\t      - Strongest cross-lang test\n1353\t    - - Between-lang at 75% depth (n=20)\n1354\t      - rho\n1355\t      - -0.73\n1356\t      - <0.001\n1357\t      - Even stronger deep\n1358\t    - - Within-lang avg (n=24 layers)\n1359\t      - rho\n1360\t      - -0.48\n1361\t      - varies\n1362\t      - 14/20 langs significant\n1363\t  - name: 'Table 12: Subspace Angle Analysis (Quantitative)'\n1364\t    columns:\n1365\t    - Measure\n1366\t    - Qwen3_235B\n1367\t    - Llama4_Scout\n1368\t    - Interpretation\n1369\t    rows:\n1370\t    - - Correctness subspace angle (avg)\n1371\t      - 11.2°\n1372\t      - 13.5°\n1373\t      - Small — cross-ling shared\n1374\t    - - Correctness subspace angle (std)\n1375\t      - 3.9°\n1376\t      - 5.7°\n1377\t      - More variable in Llama\n1378\t    - - Global representation angle (avg)\n1379\t      - 41.3°\n1380\t      - 36.1°\n1381\t      - Large — language-specific\n1382\t    - - Global/correctness ratio\n1383\t      - 3.69\n1384\t      - 2.67\n1385\t      - 'Qwen: correctness 4x more stable'\n1386\t    - - CKA cliff location\n1387\t      - 68% depth\n1388\t      - no cliff\n1389\t      - Architecture difference\n1390\t    - - CKA cliff magnitude\n1391\t      - 0.31\n1392\t      - N/A\n1393\t      - Qwen only\n1394\t  figures_description:\n1395\t  - 'Fig 6a: CKA heatmap (y=layer, x=language sorted by resource) — Qwen3. L64 处水平色带突变.'\n1396\t  - 'Fig 6b: CKA vs transfer degradation partial regression plot (controlling depth).\n1397\t    20 langs × multiple layers.'\n1398\t  - 'Fig 6c: Subspace angle comparison — bar pairs (correctness angle vs global angle)\n1399\t    per language pair. Correctness bars 远短于 global bars.'\n1400\t  - 'Fig 6d: CKA depth trajectory comparison — Qwen3 (cliff at L64) vs Llama4 (gradual).\n1401\t    Shaded region = transfer collapse zone (CKA < 0.35).'\n1402\t  analysis: 'CKA geometric analysis 成立 (partial r=0.42, p=0.008)，支撑 \"geometric analysis\"\n1403\t\n1404\t    framing。三层 evidence：(1) partial correlation 证明 CKA 有 depth 以外的解释力；\n1405\t\n1406\t    (2) between-language correlation (ρ=-0.67) 是最直接证据；(3) subspace angle ratio\n1407\t\n1408\t    3.15 提供几何直觉。CKA cliff 的有/无解释 Qwen vs Llama Pareto 差异。这是\n1409\t\n1410\t    discovery 级别 finding——连接了 representation geometry 和 practical transfer。\n1411\t\n1412\t    '\n1413\t- name: Linear Projection Sample Efficiency\n1414\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1415\t  description: Parallel pairs 数量 (10-200) 对 linear projection transfer 的影响\n1416\t  expected_results:\n1417\t    qwen_L56:\n1418\t      pairs_10:\n1419\t        auroc: 0.739\n1420\t        delta: 0.011\n1421\t        ci_width: 0.034\n1422\t      pairs_20:\n1423\t        auroc: 0.758\n1424\t        delta: 0.03\n1425\t        ci_width: 0.023\n1426\t      pairs_50:\n1427\t        auroc: 0.79\n1428\t        delta: 0.062\n1429\t        ci_width: 0.015\n1430\t      pairs_100:\n1431\t        auroc: 0.798\n1432\t        delta: 0.07\n1433\t        ci_width: 0.01\n1434\t      pairs_200:\n1435\t        auroc: 0.802\n1436\t        delta: 0.074\n1437\t        ci_width: 0.007\n1438\t    llama_L32:\n1439\t      pairs_10:\n1440\t        auroc: 0.712\n1441\t        delta: 0.021\n1442\t        ci_width: 0.031\n1443\t      pairs_20:\n1444\t        auroc: 0.729\n1445\t        delta: 0.038\n1446\t        ci_width: 0.022\n1447\t      pairs_50:\n1448\t        auroc: 0.749\n1449\t        delta: 0.058\n1450\t        ci_width: 0.014\n1451\t      pairs_100:\n1452\t        auroc: 0.757\n1453\t        delta: 0.066\n1454\t        ci_width: 0.009\n1455\t      pairs_200:\n1456\t        auroc: 0.761\n1457\t        delta: 0.07\n1458\t        ci_width: 0.006\n1459\t    elbow_point: 50\n1460\t    marginal_gain_50_to_100: 0.008\n1461\t    marginal_gain_100_to_200: 0.004\n1462\t    caclr_equivalent_pairs: 35\n1463\t  result_rationale: 'Linear projection 学习 affine transformation 将 target 语言 correctness\n1464\t    subspace\n1465\t\n1466\t    旋转对齐到 English。Correctness direction 是低维的 (实际是 1D for LR probe)，\n1467\t\n1468\t    因此旋转矩阵的自由度极低——50 pairs 已充分约束 (条件数稳定)。10 pairs 时 CI\n1469\t\n1470\t    宽 0.034 (不稳定)，50 pairs CI 收窄至 0.015。超过 50 pairs，marginal gain\n1471\t\n1472\t    从 +2.2pp/50pairs 骤降至 +0.8pp/50pairs 和 +0.4pp/100pairs。CaCLR (无 parallel\n1473\t\n1474\t    pairs 的 labels) 等效于 ~35-pair linear projection (AUROC 0.763 vs pairs_35\n1475\t\n1476\t    插值约 0.76)，表明 MMD distributional matching 实现了部分但非完全的子空间\n1477\t\n1478\t    对齐。50 pairs 的实用意义大：几乎所有 GlobalMMLU 语言都有 600+ parallel items，\n1479\t\n1480\t    随机选 50 对即可达到 plateau。\n1481\t\n1482\t    '\n1483\t  tables:\n1484\t  - name: 'Table 13: Linear Projection Sample Efficiency (Qwen3, L56)'\n1485\t    columns:\n1486\t    - Pairs\n1487\t    - AUROC_Avg\n1488\t    - Delta_vs_ZS\n1489\t    - Marginal_Gain\n1490\t    - CI_95_Width\n1491\t    rows:\n1492\t    - - 10\n1493\t      - 0.739\n1494\t      - 0.011\n1495\t      - —\n1496\t      - 0.034\n1497\t    - - 20\n1498\t      - 0.758\n1499\t      - 0.03\n1500\t      - 0.019\n1501\t      - 0.023\n1502\t    - - 50\n1503\t      - 0.79\n1504\t      - 0.062\n1505\t      - 0.032\n1506\t      - 0.015\n1507\t    - - 100\n1508\t      - 0.798\n1509\t      - 0.07\n1510\t      - 0.008\n1511\t      - 0.01\n1512\t    - - 200\n1513\t      - 0.802\n1514\t      - 0.074\n1515\t      - 0.004\n1516\t      - 0.007\n1517\t  figures_description:\n1518\t  - 'Fig 7: Sample efficiency curve (log-scale x, AUROC y). Clear elbow at 50. Horizontal\n1519\t    line = CaCLR (0.763), intersects curve at ~35 pairs.'\n1520\t  analysis: '50 pairs 是实用甜点。Linear projection 在 50 pairs 时超过 CaCLR (0.790 vs\n1521\t\n1522\t    0.763)，但需要 parallel pairs with correctness labels。两方法互补：CaCLR\n1523\t\n1524\t    for zero-label 场景，linear projection for minimal-data 场景。\n1525\t\n1526\t    '\n1527\t- name: Full-Scale Probing Control Tasks\n1528\t  plan_id: plan_013\n1529\t  description: Hewitt & Liang control tasks, 20 langs × 2 archs × all layers (扩展 MVP\n1530\t    English-only 结果)\n1531\t  expected_results:\n1532\t    selectivity_below_005_fraction: 0.1\n1533\t    low_sel_distribution:\n1534\t      early_layers_pct: 0.72\n1535\t      low_resource_pct: 0.68\n1536\t      overlap_early_AND_low: 0.54\n1537\t    qwen_selectivity_avg: 0.178\n1538\t    llama_selectivity_avg: 0.152\n1539\t    control_auroc_avg: 0.491\n1540\t    control_auroc_std: 0.012\n1541\t    control_auroc_max: 0.518\n1542\t    selectivity_grid_qwen:\n1543\t      early_HIGH: 0.045\n1544\t      early_MID: 0.036\n1545\t      early_LOW: 0.019\n1546\t      mid_HIGH: 0.142\n1547\t      mid_MID: 0.118\n1548\t      mid_LOW: 0.078\n1549\t      deep_HIGH: 0.261\n1550\t      deep_MID: 0.242\n1551\t      deep_LOW: 0.188\n1552\t    problem_zone_cells: 48\n1553\t    total_cells: 480\n1554\t    problem_zone_pct: 0.1\n1555\t    english_selectivity_deep_layers: 0.255\n1556\t    cross_lingual_selectivity_deep_layers_avg: 0.212\n1557\t    cross_lingual_selectivity_deep_layers_low_resource: 0.168\n1558\t  result_rationale: 'Control task AUROC 稳定在 ~0.49 (理论 0.50)，confirming permuted labels\n1559\t    不被\n1560\t\n1561\t    probe 学到——probing capacity 有限，不会 memorize random labels。10% 的 grid\n1562\t\n1563\t    cells 有 selectivity < 0.05，集中在 (early layers, LOW resource) 象限：\n1564\t\n1565\t    (1) Early layers (L0-L20 Qwen / L0-L12 Llama): correctness signal 尚未形成，\n1566\t\n1567\t    real probe 和 control probe 表现接近，selectivity ≈ 0；(2) Low-resource\n1568\t\n1569\t    languages: 较少的预训练数据 → correctness 编码更弱 → real probe 提升有限。\n1570\t\n1571\t    交叉：54% 的 low-selectivity cells 同时满足 early + low-resource。MVP 的\n1572\t\n1573\t    English-only plan_013 结果 (selectivity 集中在 L20-L27) 与 full-scale 一致，\n1574\t\n1575\t    但 cross-lingual extension 揭示了资源维度——英语深层 selectivity 0.255 vs\n1576\t\n1577\t    低资源深层 0.168。这本身是 methodological contribution：跨语言 probing 中\n1578\t\n1579\t    ~10% 的结果需谨慎解读。\n1580\t\n1581\t    '\n1582\t  tables:\n1583\t  - name: 'Table S5: Selectivity by Depth × Resource Tier (Qwen3)'\n1584\t    columns:\n1585\t    - Depth_Range\n1586\t    - HIGH_Resource\n1587\t    - MID_Resource\n1588\t    - LOW_Resource\n1589\t    rows:\n1590\t    - - 0-33% (early)\n1591\t      - 0.045\n1592\t      - 0.036\n1593\t      - 0.019\n1594\t    - - 33-67% (mid)\n1595\t      - 0.142\n1596\t      - 0.118\n1597\t      - 0.078\n1598\t    - - 67-100% (deep)\n1599\t      - 0.261\n1600\t      - 0.242\n1601\t      - 0.188\n1602\t  figures_description:\n1603\t  - 'Fig S4: Selectivity heatmap (y=layer, x=language sorted by resource). 左下角 (low\n1604\t    resource × early layer) 颜色最浅 (selectivity → 0).'\n1605\t  analysis: '10% capacity artifact rate 在 best tier [0.05, 0.15] 范围内。核心 probing\n1606\t\n1607\t    results (中深层 × 中高资源) selectivity > 0.10，genuine signal。Low-resource ×\n1608\t\n1609\t    early-layer zone 应在 paper 中标注为 \"interpret with caution\"。\n1610\t\n1611\t    '\n1612\t- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture\n1613\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1614\t  description: 60层 Dense (FP16), 第三架构提供 dense vs MoE 对比\n1615\t  expected_results:\n1616\t    en_best_auroc: 0.821\n1617\t    en_best_layer: 48\n1618\t    zs_transfer_auroc_avg_20lang: 0.702\n1619\t    zs_transfer_success_rate: 0.9\n1620\t    zs_fail_langs:\n1621\t    - yo\n1622\t    - am\n1623\t    pareto_spearman_rho_global: -0.52\n1624\t    cka_pattern: gradual decline, onset deeper than Llama (no cliff)\n1625\t    cka_correctness_subspace_angle_avg: 13.1\n1626\t    caclr_delta_auroc_avg: 0.039\n1627\t  result_rationale: 'Dense 31B 没有 MoE routing，表征特化更均匀 (无 expert 分配的 language-specific\n1628\t\n1629\t    路径)，Pareto ρ=-0.52 介于 Qwen3 (ρ=-0.65, 强 MoE cliff) 和 Llama4 (ρ=-0.33,\n1630\t\n1631\t    弱 MoE) 之间。EN AUROC 0.821 反映 31B dense 的容量低于 235B 但高于 17B active。\n1632\t\n1633\t    CKA 渐降模式接近 Llama 但 onset 更深——dense model 在中间层保持更强的跨语言\n1634\t\n1635\t    共享 (无 expert routing 导致的早期分化)。Dense 架构的 Pareto 中等强度提供了\n1636\t\n1637\t    theory-consistent 的三点比较：cliff MoE (Qwen) > dense (Gemma) > gradual MoE\n1638\t\n1639\t    (Llama)。仅 yo/am 失败 (2/20)，success rate 0.90。CaCLR delta +3.9pp 低于\n1640\t\n1641\t    Qwen (+4.7pp) 但高于 Llama (+4.1pp)——dense 的初始 ZS transfer 已较好 (CKA\n1642\t\n1643\t    更高)，CaCLR 的 marginal room 稍小。\n1644\t\n1645\t    '\n1646\t  tables:\n1647\t  - name: 'Table 14: Three-Architecture Comparison'\n1648\t    columns:\n1649\t    - Architecture\n1650\t    - Type\n1651\t    - EN_AUROC\n1652\t    - ZS_Avg\n1653\t    - Pareto_rho\n1654\t    - CKA_Pattern\n1655\t    - CaCLR_Delta\n1656\t    rows:\n1657\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n1658\t      - MoE (Int4)\n1659\t      - 0.832\n1660\t      - 0.713\n1661\t      - -0.65\n1662\t      - Cliff at 68%\n1663\t      - 0.047\n1664\t    - - Gemma4-31B\n1665\t      - Dense (FP16)\n1666\t      - 0.821\n1667\t      - 0.702\n1668\t      - -0.52\n1669\t      - Gradual, deep onset\n1670\t      - 0.039\n1671\t    - - Llama4-Scout\n1672\t      - MoE (W4A16)\n1673\t      - 0.811\n1674\t      - 0.684\n1675\t      - -0.33\n1676\t      - Gradual, early onset\n1677\t      - 0.041\n1678\t  figures_description:\n1679\t  - 'Fig 8: Three-architecture Pareto overlay — Qwen (steep, clear frontier), Gemma\n1680\t    (moderate), Llama (flat, scattered). 三种斜率直观展示 architecture dependence.'\n1681\t  analysis: '第三架构填充了 dense vs MoE 对比。Pareto 强度排序 (Qwen > Gemma > Llama) 与\n1682\t\n1683\t    架构差异一致：MoE cliff 产生最强 tradeoff，dense 渐降产生中等 tradeoff，\n1684\t\n1685\t    无 cliff 的 MoE 最弱。Camera-ready 的 n=3 架构虽仍不足以做因果归因 (type,\n1686\t\n1687\t    scale, layers, training data 均不同)，但三点一致的模式 strengthens \"architecture-\n1688\t\n1689\t    dependent tradeoff\" 的 observational claim。\n1690\t\n1691\t    '\n1692\t- name: Extended Language Coverage (50+)\n1693\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1694\t  description: 扩展至 50+ 语言 (GlobalMMLU + Belebele full sets)\n1695\t  expected_results:\n1696\t    total_languages: 53\n1697\t    zs_success_rate: 0.83\n1698\t    n_success: 44\n1699\t    n_fail: 9\n1700\t    fail_langs:\n1701\t    - am\n1702\t    - my\n1703\t    - yo\n1704\t    - si\n1705\t    - lo\n1706\t    - km\n1707\t    - gu\n1708\t    - or\n1709\t    - ne\n1710\t    pareto_rho_qwen_global_53: -0.62\n1711\t    pareto_rho_llama_global_53: -0.31\n1712\t    resource_tier_gradient_r2: 0.71\n1713\t    new_findings:\n1714\t      dravidian_cluster: ta/ml/kn 形成 cluster, ZS AUROC 0.64-0.68, transfer 特征接近 MID\n1715\t        tier\n1716\t      austronesian_cluster: id/ms/tl transfer 异常好 (0.72-0.74)，因为与英语的表征对齐度高\n1717\t      uralic_outlier: fi/hu ZS AUROC 差异大 (fi 0.69 vs hu 0.65)，尽管同为 Uralic\n1718\t    caclr_delta_avg_53: 0.044\n1719\t    caclr_delta_new_langs_avg: 0.041\n1720\t  result_rationale: '扩展至 53 语言后，成功率从 ~90% (20 langs) 降至 83% (53 langs)，因为新增\n1721\t\n1722\t    语言多为 extreme low-resource (si, lo, km 等)。但 Pareto ρ 和主要 patterns\n1723\t\n1724\t    保持稳定 (Qwen ρ=-0.62 vs -0.65 at 20 langs)，slight reduction 因为新增的\n1725\t\n1726\t    低资源语言削弱了 global correlation。Resource tier gradient 在更大样本下更\n1727\t\n1728\t    robust (R²=0.71, up from ~0.60 at 20 langs)。Austronesian 语言 (id/ms/tl)\n1729\t\n1730\t    transfer 异常好，因为这些语言在大模型预训练中常被 grouped with English-heavy\n1731\t\n1732\t    corpora (code-switching, romanization)。CaCLR 增益在新增语言上 (+4.1pp) 与\n1733\t\n1734\t    原 20 语言 (+4.7pp) 相当，confirming method generalizability。\n1735\t\n1736\t    '\n1737\t  tables:\n1738\t  - name: 'Table S6: Extended Language Coverage Summary'\n1739\t    columns:\n1740\t    - Metric\n1741\t    - 20_Langs\n1742\t    - 53_Langs\n1743\t    rows:\n1744\t    - - ZS Success Rate\n1745\t      - 95% (Qwen)\n1746\t      - 83%\n1747\t    - - Pareto ρ Qwen\n1748\t      - -0.65\n1749\t      - -0.62\n1750\t    - - Pareto ρ Llama\n1751\t      - -0.33\n1752\t      - -0.31\n1753\t    - - Resource Gradient R²\n1754\t      - ~0.60\n1755\t      - 0.71\n1756\t    - - CaCLR Δ AUROC avg\n1757\t      - 0.047\n1758\t      - 0.044\n1759\t  figures_description:\n1760\t  - 'Fig S5: 53-language ZS success rate by resource tier. Clear gradient: HIGH ~98%,\n1761\t    MID ~90%, LOW ~65%.'\n1762\t  analysis: 'Camera-ready 扩展确认 core findings 跨 50+ 语言成立。9 种 fail 语言均为\n1763\t\n1764\t    extreme low-resource (预训练 tokens < 100M)，consistent with domain adaptation\n1765\t\n1766\t    theory 的 H-divergence 预测。Austronesian cluster 的高 transfer 是 interesting\n1767\t\n1768\t    secondary finding。'\n1769\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5336efaf-2e22-419f-b322-39a8a1fc07df","uuid":"a1f86289-e4fa-4abe-8bee-e969dfb297ca","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:22:21.862Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T032808/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'CaCLR 是正面方法贡献——β > 0 的 MMD consistency loss 在 probe logits 空间成功\n\n  对齐 correctness subspace，使零标签跨语言校准成为可能。Pareto frontier 在两种\n\n  架构上均 robust：Qwen3-235B 呈强负相关 (ρ ≈ -0.65)，Llama 4 Scout 呈弱但一致\n\n  的负相关 (ρ ≈ -0.33)。CKA partial correlation 控制 depth 后仍显著 (r ≈ 0.42,\n\n  p < 0.01)，支撑 geometric analysis framing。四个 claims 均以强形式提出，论文\n\n  以 method + discovery 双重贡献投稿。\n\n  Headline: \"CaCLR enables zero-label cross-lingual calibration, reducing non-English\n\n  ECE by 22% vs temperature scaling across 20 languages on two architectures.\"\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Qwen3-235B Full Pareto Frontier\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 94层 MoE (INT4), 24 probed layers (每4层), 20语言, 4 transfer conditions\n    (CaCLR 在 plan_003)\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.832\n    en_best_layer: 72\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.548\n    - 0.832\n    en_best_ece_raw: 0.126\n    zs_transfer_auroc_avg_20lang: 0.713\n    zs_transfer_success_rate: 0.95\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - am\n    pareto_spearman_rho_global: -0.65\n    pareto_spearman_rho_per_lang_range:\n    - -0.82\n    - -0.41\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_avg: 0.773\n      MID_avg: 0.719\n      LOW_avg: 0.635\n    zs_best_by_lang:\n      zh:\n        auroc: 0.79\n        best_layer: 56\n      es:\n        auroc: 0.78\n        best_layer: 60\n      fr:\n        auroc: 0.77\n        best_layer: 56\n      de:\n        auroc: 0.77\n        best_layer: 60\n      ja:\n        auroc: 0.75\n        best_layer: 52\n      pt:\n        auroc: 0.78\n        best_layer: 56\n      it:\n        auroc: 0.77\n        best_layer: 60\n      hi:\n        auroc: 0.73\n        best_layer: 48\n      ru:\n        auroc: 0.74\n        best_layer: 52\n      ko:\n        auroc: 0.73\n        best_layer: 52\n      tr:\n        auroc: 0.7\n        best_layer: 44\n      vi:\n        auroc: 0.71\n        best_layer: 48\n      ar:\n        auroc: 0.72\n        best_layer: 52\n      th:\n        auroc: 0.7\n        best_layer: 44\n      sw:\n        auroc: 0.65\n        best_layer: 40\n      bn:\n        auroc: 0.66\n        best_layer: 44\n      yo:\n        auroc: 0.61\n        best_layer: 36\n      te:\n        auroc: 0.66\n        best_layer: 44\n      my:\n        auroc: 0.63\n        best_layer: 36\n      am:\n        auroc: 0.598\n        best_layer: 36\n    depth_transfer_snapshot:\n      en_at_L72: 0.832\n      zs_avg_at_L72: 0.672\n      en_at_L56: 0.812\n      zs_avg_at_L56: 0.728\n      en_at_L40: 0.762\n      zs_avg_at_L40: 0.706\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linear_proj_50_delta_auroc_avg: 0.062\n    fewshot_25_auroc_avg: 0.738\n    fewshot_100_auroc_avg: 0.768\n    bootstrap_ci_width_auroc: 0.018\n  result_rationale: '235B MoE 拥有远比 7B 更结构化的内部表征。MVP Qwen2.5-7B EN best AUROC = 0.754;\n\n    235B 的 correctness direction 在中高层 (L48-L72) 线性可分度大幅提升至 0.83，\n\n    与 probing 文献中 \"larger model → more linearly accessible features\" 的规律一致。\n\n    更大模型的多语言预训练数据量级增加约 5-10x，跨语言对齐更强，zero-shot transfer\n\n    avg 从 MVP ~0.65 提升至 ~0.71。94 层结构提供精细 depth 分辨率：EN-optimal L72\n\n    (77% depth) 与 transfer-optimal zone L52-56 (55-60% depth) 间有 ~16 层间距，\n\n    产生清晰的强负相关 ρ ≈ -0.65。低资源语言的 ρ 更负 (sw -0.79, yo -0.82)，\n\n    因为这些语言在深层的表征特化最剧烈——模型的 language-specific expert routing\n\n    在深层对高资源语言保持跨语言共享，但对低资源语言已切换至 language-specific pathway。\n\n    Mean-shift AUROC delta 严格为零 (数学证明: StandardScaler + LR → 常数偏移 → rank\n\n    不变 → AUROC 不变)。仅 am (Amharic) 以 0.598 未达 0.60 阈值，因为 Qwen3 的\n\n    Amharic 预训练数据极少。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier — Per-Language Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Language\n    - Family\n    - Resource\n    - Best_ZS_AUROC\n    - Best_ZS_Layer\n    - EN_AUROC_at_Same_Layer\n    - Spearman_rho\n    - rho_p\n    representative_rows:\n    - - zh\n      - Sinitic\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.79\n      - L56\n      - 0.812\n      - -0.58\n      - 0.003\n    - - es\n      - Romance\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.78\n      - L60\n      - 0.821\n      - -0.53\n      - 0.008\n    - - ja\n      - Japonic\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.75\n      - L52\n      - 0.802\n      - -0.62\n      - 0.001\n    - - hi\n      - Indo-Aryan\n      - MID\n      - 0.73\n      - L48\n      - 0.789\n      - -0.67\n      - <0.001\n    - - ko\n      - Koreanic\n      - MID\n      - 0.73\n      - L52\n      - 0.802\n      - -0.61\n      - 0.002\n    - - ar\n      - Semitic\n      - MID\n      - 0.72\n      - L52\n      - 0.802\n      - -0.59\n      - 0.003\n    - - sw\n      - Bantu\n      - LOW\n      - 0.65\n      - L40\n      - 0.762\n      - -0.79\n      - <0.001\n    - - yo\n      - Volta-Niger\n      - LOW\n      - 0.61\n      - L36\n      - 0.721\n      - -0.82\n      - <0.001\n    - - am\n      - Ethiosemitic\n      - LOW\n      - 0.598\n      - L36\n      - 0.721\n      - -0.81\n      - <0.001\n  - name: 'Table 2: Transfer Conditions Comparison (Qwen3-235B, L56 Pareto Zone)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - AUROC_Avg_20L\n    - AUROC_HIGH\n    - AUROC_MID\n    - AUROC_LOW\n    - ECE_Avg\n    rows:\n    - - Zero-shot\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.773\n      - 0.726\n      - 0.648\n      - 0.165\n    - - Mean-shift\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.773\n      - 0.726\n      - 0.648\n      - 0.168\n    - - Linear_proj_50\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.139\n    - - Few-shot_25\n      - 0.745\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.742\n      - 0.668\n      - 0.152\n    - - Few-shot_100\n      - 0.774\n      - 0.811\n      - 0.773\n      - 0.702\n      - 0.136\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1a: Heatmap (y=24 layers, x=20 langs sorted by resource tier). Color = ZS\n    AUROC. 深层左侧 (高资源) 保持暖色，深层右侧 (低资源) 转冷，显示 resource-dependent depth degradation.'\n  - 'Fig 1b: Pareto scatter — x=EN AUROC, y=avg ZS transfer AUROC (each point = one\n    layer, color = normalized depth). 清晰负斜率 ρ=-0.65, 右下角 (深层) 聚集.'\n  - 'Fig 1c: Per-language Spearman ρ bar chart (grouped by resource tier). 低资源 bars\n    更长 (更负).'\n  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 呈现教科书级 Pareto frontier。关键发现：(1) ρ=-0.65 远强于 MVP\n\n    7B 的约 -0.4，confirming 更大模型 → 更 structured representations → 更清晰\n\n    tradeoff；(2) transfer-optimal zone 在 40-60% depth (L36-L56)，EN-optimal 在\n\n    77% (L72)，gap = 16 层；(3) resource tier gradient: HIGH 0.77 > MID 0.72 > LOW\n\n    0.64，三级分明；(4) 19/20 languages transfer 成功，仅 am 失败。Linear proj\n\n    (50 pairs) 是最强迁移方法 (+6.2pp over ZS)，few-shot 100 紧随 (+4.6pp)。\n\n    '\n- name: Llama 4 Scout Full Pareto Frontier\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: 48层 MoE (W4A16), 12 probed layers, 20语言, 4 transfer conditions\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.811\n    en_best_layer: 40\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.574\n    - 0.811\n    en_best_ece_raw: 0.139\n    zs_transfer_auroc_avg_20lang: 0.684\n    zs_transfer_success_rate: 0.85\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - my\n    - am\n    pareto_spearman_rho_global: -0.33\n    pareto_spearman_rho_per_lang_range:\n    - -0.68\n    - 0.18\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_avg: 0.743\n      MID_avg: 0.694\n      LOW_avg: 0.602\n    zs_best_by_lang:\n      zh:\n        auroc: 0.76\n        best_layer: 36\n      es:\n        auroc: 0.75\n        best_layer: 36\n      fr:\n        auroc: 0.74\n        best_layer: 32\n      de:\n        auroc: 0.74\n        best_layer: 36\n      ja:\n        auroc: 0.72\n        best_layer: 32\n      pt:\n        auroc: 0.75\n        best_layer: 36\n      it:\n        auroc: 0.74\n        best_layer: 36\n      hi:\n        auroc: 0.7\n        best_layer: 36\n      ru:\n        auroc: 0.72\n        best_layer: 40\n      ko:\n        auroc: 0.71\n        best_layer: 40\n      tr:\n        auroc: 0.67\n        best_layer: 32\n      vi:\n        auroc: 0.69\n        best_layer: 32\n      ar:\n        auroc: 0.7\n        best_layer: 40\n      th:\n        auroc: 0.67\n        best_layer: 28\n      sw:\n        auroc: 0.62\n        best_layer: 28\n      bn:\n        auroc: 0.63\n        best_layer: 28\n      yo:\n        auroc: 0.57\n        best_layer: 24\n      te:\n        auroc: 0.64\n        best_layer: 28\n      my:\n        auroc: 0.58\n        best_layer: 24\n      am:\n        auroc: 0.57\n        best_layer: 24\n    depth_transfer_snapshot:\n      en_at_L40: 0.811\n      zs_avg_at_L40: 0.654\n      en_at_L32: 0.781\n      zs_avg_at_L32: 0.691\n      en_at_L24: 0.732\n      zs_avg_at_L24: 0.682\n    langs_with_positive_depth_rho:\n    - ru\n    - ko\n    - ar\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linear_proj_50_delta_auroc_avg: 0.058\n    fewshot_25_auroc_avg: 0.706\n    fewshot_100_auroc_avg: 0.741\n  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout (17B active × 16 experts, ~109B total) 的 EN AUROC\n    达到 0.811，\n\n    低于 Qwen3-235B 但显著高于 MVP Llama-3.1-8B (0.728)。Pareto frontier 呈弱\n\n    负相关 ρ ≈ -0.33，延续 MVP 中 Llama 架构的模式：部分语言 (ru, ko, ar) 随\n\n    depth 增加迁移不退化甚至略微改善 (ρ > 0)，而 sw/yo/am 退化严重 (ρ < -0.60)。\n\n    这种异质性源于 Llama 4 的 16-expert MoE routing：对 ru/ko/ar 等中高资源语言，\n\n    深层 expert routing 倾向于重用与 English 共享的 expert；对低资源语言则分配到\n\n    specialized expert，导致表征分离。三种低资源语言 (yo 0.57, my 0.58, am 0.57)\n\n    未通过 0.60 阈值，success rate 17/20 = 0.85 达到 best tier 下限。48 层仅\n\n    12 probed layers，depth 分辨率低于 Qwen3 (24 layers)，ρ 估计的统计功效较低\n\n    (n=12 vs n=24)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier — Per-Language Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Language\n    - Family\n    - Resource\n    - Best_ZS_AUROC\n    - Best_ZS_Layer\n    - Spearman_rho\n    - rho_p\n    representative_rows:\n    - - zh\n      - Sinitic\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.76\n      - L36\n      - -0.45\n      - 0.14\n    - - es\n      - Romance\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.75\n      - L36\n      - -0.41\n      - 0.18\n    - - ru\n      - Slavic\n      - MID\n      - 0.72\n      - L40\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.88\n    - - ko\n      - Koreanic\n      - MID\n      - 0.71\n      - L40\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.57\n    - - ar\n      - Semitic\n      - MID\n      - 0.7\n      - L40\n      - -0.12\n      - 0.71\n    - - sw\n      - Bantu\n      - LOW\n      - 0.62\n      - L28\n      - -0.62\n      - 0.03\n    - - yo\n      - Volta-Niger\n      - LOW\n      - 0.57\n      - L24\n      - -0.68\n      - 0.02\n    - - am\n      - Ethiosemitic\n      - LOW\n      - 0.57\n      - L24\n      - -0.65\n      - 0.02\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2a: Pareto scatter (同 Fig 1b 格式) — 扁平斜率 ρ=-0.33, scatter 更大. ru/ko 偏离主趋势\n    (正方向).'\n  - 'Fig 2b: Per-language ρ comparison — Qwen3 vs Llama4 并排 bar chart. Qwen3 全负; Llama4\n    有 3 语言正值.'\n  - 'Fig 2c: Language-specific depth trajectory — 选 ru (上升), zh (平), sw (下降) 对比 Llama4\n    的异质性.'\n  analysis: 'Llama 4 Scout 的 Pareto 显著弱于 Qwen3-235B，core finding: architecture\n\n    determines tradeoff shape。ρ_Qwen=-0.65 vs ρ_Llama=-0.33, 且 Llama 呈现\n\n    language-specific 异质性 (3 种语言 ρ > 0)。这不是 Pareto 不存在——global ρ\n\n    仍为负——而是 tradeoff 在不同语言上表现不同。论文中框架为 \"strong vs weak\n\n    Pareto\" 的架构对比。\n\n    '\n- name: CaCLR Full Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_MMD, 两种架构×20语言完整评估\n  expected_results:\n    best_alpha: 1.0\n    best_beta: 0.1\n    alpha_sweep:\n      0.01:\n        auroc: 0.741\n        ece: 0.148\n      0.1:\n        auroc: 0.749\n        ece: 0.138\n      1.0:\n        auroc: 0.763\n        ece: 0.121\n      10.0:\n        auroc: 0.752\n        ece: 0.128\n    beta_sweep:\n      0.0:\n        auroc: 0.724\n        ece: 0.148\n      0.001:\n        auroc: 0.728\n        ece: 0.145\n      0.01:\n        auroc: 0.738\n        ece: 0.137\n      0.1:\n        auroc: 0.763\n        ece: 0.121\n      1.0:\n        auroc: 0.731\n        ece: 0.141\n    qwen_L56_pareto_zone:\n      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.763\n      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.728\n      delta_auroc: 0.035\n      caclr_ece_avg: 0.121\n      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.155\n      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.034\n    qwen_L72_en_optimal:\n      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.728\n      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.672\n      delta_auroc: 0.056\n      caclr_ece_avg: 0.132\n      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.171\n      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.039\n    qwen_oracle_per_lang:\n      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.76\n      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.713\n      delta_auroc: 0.047\n    llama_L32_pareto_zone:\n      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.732\n      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.691\n      delta_auroc: 0.041\n      caclr_ece_avg: 0.131\n      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.163\n      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.032\n    llama_L40_en_optimal:\n      caclr_auroc_avg: 0.697\n      zeroshot_auroc_avg: 0.654\n      delta_auroc: 0.043\n      caclr_ece_avg: 0.142\n      tempscaling_ece_avg: 0.176\n      delta_ece_vs_tempscaling: -0.034\n    ablation:\n      bce_only:\n        auroc: 0.728\n        ece: 0.165\n      bce_sbece:\n        auroc: 0.724\n        ece: 0.148\n      bce_mmd:\n        auroc: 0.751\n        ece: 0.136\n      bce_sbece_mmd:\n        auroc: 0.763\n        ece: 0.121\n    beta_vs_zero_paired_permutation_p: 0.003\n    beta_vs_zero_cohens_d: 0.52\n    beta_vs_zero_bootstrap_ci:\n    - 0.024\n    - 0.058\n    caclr_delta_by_tier:\n      HIGH: 0.031\n      MID: 0.048\n      LOW: 0.068\n    pareto_rho_without_caclr: -0.65\n    pareto_rho_with_caclr: -0.51\n    pareto_shift_interpretation: CaCLR 减弱 Pareto tradeoff (rho 从 -0.65 到 -0.51), 因为深层迁移退化被部分修复\n    mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n    optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, cosine decay to 1e-5\n    epochs: 50\n    early_stopping: patience=10, monitor val BCE loss\n    initialization: warm-start from standard LR solution\n    batch_size: 256\n    mmd_items: same items as BCE (probe_train portion)\n    parallel_set_size_per_lang_avg: 630\n    parallel_set_size_per_lang_min: 580\n    translation_quality_note: am/yo/my translations spot-checked, ~8% semantic drift\n      vs high-resource\n  result_rationale: 'Best tier 核心假设：\"MMD on probe logits 成功对齐 correctness subspace\n    cross-\n\n    lingually\"。为何成立：(1) 235B 模型的 correctness direction 占据低维语言无关\n\n    子空间 (CKA 分析支持)，因此 1D probe logit 的分布差异主要反映 subspace rotation\n\n    而非 intrinsic signal difference；MMD 通过匹配 logit 分布有效纠正这个 rotation。\n\n    (2) β=0.1 是 sweet spot——足以施加对齐压力 (MMD loss ~0.3 量级) 但不 overwhelm\n\n    BCE loss (初始 ~0.65 量级)；β=1.0 过大导致 MMD dominate，probe 为匹配分布而\n\n    牺牲判别力。(3) SB-ECE 单独贡献有限 (+0.006 AUROC)，但与 MMD 叠加有协同：\n\n    SB-ECE 改善 probability calibration 后，MMD 在更好校准的 logit 空间上匹配更\n\n    有效。(4) 低资源语言获益最大 (+0.068)，因为 zero-shot distribution gap 最大，\n\n    MMD 的边际对齐收益最高——与 Ben-David et al. H-divergence 理论一致。(5) 在\n\n    EN-optimal 深层 L72，CaCLR 增益更大 (+0.056 > +0.035)，因为深层迁移退化更\n\n    严重，recovery space 更大——直接证明 \"CaCLR shifts the Pareto frontier\"。\n\n    统计显著性: paired permutation test p=0.003, Cohen''s d=0.52 (medium effect),\n\n    bootstrap 95% CI [0.024, 0.058] 不含零。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: CaCLR vs All Baselines (Fixed Layer, Pareto Zone)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Qwen3_AUROC\n    - Qwen3_ECE\n    - Llama4_AUROC\n    - Llama4_ECE\n    - Labels_Required\n    rows:\n    - - Zero-shot\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.165\n      - 0.691\n      - 0.179\n      - EN only\n    - - Mean-shift\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.168\n      - 0.691\n      - 0.183\n      - EN only\n    - - Temp scaling\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.155\n      - 0.691\n      - 0.163\n      - EN only\n    - - CaCLR (α=1 β=0.1)\n      - 0.763\n      - 0.121\n      - 0.732\n      - 0.131\n      - EN only + parallel inputs\n    - - Linear proj (50)\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.139\n      - 0.749\n      - 0.146\n      - 50 parallel pairs\n    - - Few-shot (25)\n      - 0.745\n      - 0.152\n      - 0.712\n      - 0.159\n      - 25 target labels\n    - - Few-shot (100)\n      - 0.774\n      - 0.136\n      - 0.745\n      - 0.142\n      - 100 target labels\n  - name: 'Table 5: Component Ablation (Qwen3-235B, L56, Avg 20 Langs)'\n    columns:\n    - Components\n    - AUROC\n    - ECE\n    - Delta_AUROC_vs_ZS\n    rows:\n    - - BCE only (= zero-shot)\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.165\n      - —\n    - - BCE + SB-ECE\n      - 0.724\n      - 0.148\n      - -0.004\n    - - BCE + MMD\n      - 0.751\n      - 0.136\n      - 0.023\n    - - BCE + SB-ECE + MMD\n      - 0.763\n      - 0.121\n      - 0.035\n  - name: 'Table 6: β Sensitivity (α=1.0 fixed, Qwen3 L56)'\n    columns:\n    - beta\n    - AUROC\n    - ECE\n    - Delta_vs_beta0\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0\n      - 0.724\n      - 0.148\n      - —\n    - - 0.001\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.145\n      - 0.004\n    - - 0.01\n      - 0.738\n      - 0.137\n      - 0.014\n    - - 0.1\n      - 0.763\n      - 0.121\n      - 0.039\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.731\n      - 0.141\n      - 0.007\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3a: α-β grid heatmap (AUROC as color). Peak region around (α=1.0, β=0.1),\n    smooth gradient.'\n  - 'Fig 3b: CaCLR Pareto shift — Qwen3 scatter overlay: gray=zero-shot per-layer,\n    red=CaCLR per-layer. Red points shifted up-right, ρ flattens from -0.65 to -0.51.'\n  - 'Fig 3c: Per-language CaCLR gain (Δ AUROC), grouped by resource tier. LOW tier\n    bars tallest.'\n  - 'Fig 3d: β sweep curve (log scale x, AUROC y). Inverted-U, peak at β=0.1.'\n  analysis: 'β > 0 统计显著地改善跨语言迁移 (p=0.003, d=0.52)。CaCLR 的核心价值：完全不需要\n\n    target-language correctness labels，仅需 parallel inputs (已通过 GlobalMMLU\n\n    翻译存在)。CaCLR 未超过 linear projection (50 pairs): 0.763 vs 0.790，但\n\n    CaCLR 无需 paired correctness labels。Two methods 互补：CaCLR 适用于无 parallel\n\n    pairs 的场景，linear projection 在有少量 parallel data 时更优。CaCLR 在深层\n\n    (EN-optimal) 增益更大 (+0.056) 证明它 shifts Pareto frontier，不只是 uniform\n\n    improvement。ECE reduction 22% vs temp scaling 构成论文 headline。\n\n    '\n- name: Difficulty-Controlled Decomposition\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: IRT difficulty probe → project out → retrain → transfer delta. 10 langs\n    × 8 layers × 2 models\n  expected_results:\n    difficulty_probe_r2_avg: 0.61\n    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n    - 0.43\n    - 0.76\n    difficulty_probe_r2_by_lang:\n      zh: 0.72\n      es: 0.76\n      de: 0.68\n      fr: 0.71\n      hi: 0.58\n      ru: 0.65\n      ko: 0.63\n      tr: 0.53\n      sw: 0.43\n      bn: 0.47\n    avg_transfer_delta_after_projection: 0.035\n    delta_by_lang_category:\n      capability_dominated:\n        langs:\n        - zh\n        - es\n        - fr\n        - de\n        - ru\n        - ko\n        delta: 0.042\n        ci:\n        - 0.031\n        - 0.054\n      difficulty_dominated:\n        langs:\n        - hi\n        - tr\n        - sw\n        - bn\n        delta: -0.018\n        ci:\n        - -0.029\n        - -0.007\n    random_projection_delta_avg: -0.003\n    random_projection_delta_std: 0.008\n    random_projection_delta_ci:\n    - -0.011\n    - 0.005\n    delta_by_depth:\n      20%: 0.012\n      35%: 0.021\n      50%: 0.035\n      65%: 0.043\n      80%: 0.051\n      90%: 0.048\n    qwen_avg_delta: 0.038\n    llama_avg_delta: 0.031\n    predicted_vs_actual_alignment_strategy_accuracy: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'Correctness signal 是 difficulty (跨语言共享——哪些题目本身更难) 和 capability\n\n    (语言特异性——模型在该语言上的推理能力) 的纠缠。对于 capability-dominated 语言\n\n    (高资源, 模型具备强推理)，difficulty 是共享但无用的噪声维度：projecting out\n\n    移除了对迁移有害的 confound，暴露纯粹的 capability signal，transfer 改善\n\n    +4.2pp。对于 difficulty-dominated 语言 (低资源, 模型 capability 弱)，difficulty\n\n    本身是 correctness 的主要来源 (模型答对题目主要靠题目简单，而非语言能力)——\n\n    移除它丢失了唯一可迁移的信号，transfer 下降 -1.8pp。深层 delta 更大 (80%\n\n    depth: +5.1pp vs 20%: +1.2pp)，因为 capability 特化在深层更强，difficulty\n\n    confound 的 relative 权重在深层更大。Random direction control 的 delta ≈ 0\n\n    排除了纯降维的 artifact。IRT difficulty probe R² 呈 resource gradient (zh 0.72\n\n    > sw 0.43)，因为 IRT difficulty scores 基于高资源语言的人类答题数据，低资源\n\n    语言的 difficulty 编码较弱。Prescriptive accuracy 82% 表明 decomposition\n\n    能正确预测 8/10 语言应该用哪种 alignment strategy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Difficulty Decomposition Effect by Language Category'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Languages\n    - N_langs\n    - Delta_AUROC\n    - CI_95\n    - Random_Control\n    rows:\n    - - Capability-dominated\n      - zh/es/fr/de/ru/ko\n      - 6\n      - 0.042\n      - '[0.031, 0.054]'\n      - -0.002\n    - - Difficulty-dominated\n      - hi/tr/sw/bn\n      - 4\n      - -0.018\n      - '[-0.029, -0.007]'\n      - -0.004\n    - - Overall\n      - all 10\n      - 10\n      - 0.035\n      - '[0.021, 0.049]'\n      - -0.003\n  - name: 'Table 8: Depth × Decomposition Interaction'\n    columns:\n    - Depth_Pct\n    - EN_Probe_AUROC\n    - ZS_Delta_After_Proj\n    - ZS_Delta_Capability_Only\n    - ZS_Delta_Difficulty_Only\n    rows:\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.018\n      - -0.008\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.042\n      - -0.016\n    - - 80%\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.051\n      - 0.061\n      - -0.023\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4a: Scatter — x = baseline ZS transfer AUROC (proxy for capability), y =\n    Δ AUROC after difficulty projection. 正相关: capability 越高, projection 越有益. 虚线 =\n    decision boundary (Δ=0).'\n  - 'Fig 4b: Depth × delta line plot — separate lines for capability-dominated (上升)\n    vs difficulty-dominated (下降) 语言.'\n  analysis: 'Decomposition 成功分离 difficulty/capability，fulfilling Claim 2。Prescriptive\n\n    value: 对于 capability-dominated 语言 (baseline ZS > ~0.70)，projecting out\n\n    difficulty 是 free lunch (+4.2pp)。对于 difficulty-dominated 语言 (baseline ZS\n\n    < ~0.65)，应保留 difficulty 信号。82% prediction accuracy 表明这个规则可\n\n    自动化为 per-language strategy selector。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Lingual Orthogonality\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: Correctness vs verbalized confidence direction cosine similarity, 20\n    langs × 2 archs\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_range:\n    - 0.012\n    - 0.058\n    cosine_mean: 0.032\n    cosine_std: 0.013\n    cosine_by_tier:\n      HIGH: 0.027\n      MID: 0.033\n      LOW: 0.04\n    cosine_by_arch:\n      Qwen3: 0.029\n      Llama4: 0.035\n    cosine_extremes:\n      min:\n        lang: es\n        arch: Qwen3\n        value: 0.012\n      max:\n        lang: am\n        arch: Llama4\n        value: 0.058\n    cosine_per_lang:\n      en:\n        qwen: 0.023\n        llama: 0.03\n      zh:\n        qwen: 0.021\n        llama: 0.028\n      es:\n        qwen: 0.012\n        llama: 0.024\n      hi:\n        qwen: 0.032\n        llama: 0.039\n      sw:\n        qwen: 0.042\n        llama: 0.049\n      am:\n        qwen: 0.048\n        llama: 0.058\n    permutation_test_vs_random_p: <0.001\n    cosine_vs_resource_rho: 0.34\n    cosine_vs_resource_p: 0.042\n  result_rationale: 'Correctness 和 verbalized confidence 的正交性 (cosine < 0.06) 是 transformer\n\n    架构的内在特征：模型学会了在独立的表征子空间中编码 \"我是否答对了\" (correctness)\n\n    和 \"我认为我有多确定\" (confidence)。这不是 English-specific 现象。正交性在\n\n    所有 20 种语言上持续成立，因为两个方向都由模型的参数化决定，不由输入语言决定。\n\n    低资源语言的 cosine 略高 (0.040 vs 0.027) 有两个原因：(1) confidence probe\n\n    在低资源语言上的 SNR 更低，噪声使 cosine 估计偏离零；(2) 低资源语言的表征\n\n    空间利用率低，两个方向在低维子空间中更容易有 spurious overlap。但即使最高\n\n    的 am=0.058 仍远低于表示有意义相关性的阈值 (~0.2)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality Across Languages'\n    columns:\n    - Language\n    - Resource\n    - Qwen3_Cosine\n    - Llama4_Cosine\n    - Average\n    representative_rows:\n    - - en\n      - —\n      - 0.023\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.027\n    - - zh\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.021\n      - 0.028\n      - 0.025\n    - - es\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.024\n      - 0.018\n    - - hi\n      - MID\n      - 0.032\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.036\n    - - ko\n      - MID\n      - 0.028\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.032\n    - - sw\n      - LOW\n      - 0.042\n      - 0.049\n      - 0.046\n    - - am\n      - LOW\n      - 0.048\n      - 0.058\n      - 0.053\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Cosine similarity dot plot — 每个点 = 一种语言, x = Qwen3 cosine, y = Llama4\n    cosine. 所有点聚集在 [0, 0.06] × [0, 0.06] 区域, 远离 identity line. 虚线 = Miao & Ungar English\n    reference (0.04).'\n  analysis: 'Claim 4 完全成立。Output-based calibration 的结构性限制是跨语言普遍的——\n\n    所有 40 个 (language, architecture) 组合的 cosine < 0.06。Resource tier 与\n\n    cosine 弱正相关 (ρ=0.34, p=0.042)，但 effect size 极小 (range 仅 0.013)。\n\n    这进一步 motivate probe-based calibration：output 层面的信息理论限制不随\n\n    语言变化。\n\n    '\n- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP: EN accuracy 和 cross-lingual transfer\n    对比'\n  expected_results:\n    lr_en_best_auroc: 0.832\n    mlp_en_best_auroc: 0.851\n    mlp_en_advantage: 0.019\n    lr_zs_auroc_avg: 0.713\n    mlp_zs_auroc_avg: 0.685\n    lr_zs_advantage: 0.028\n    lr_relative_degradation: 0.143\n    mlp_relative_degradation: 0.195\n    mlp_excess_degradation: 0.052\n    lr_zs_low: 0.635\n    mlp_zs_low: 0.581\n    lr_vs_mlp_gap_low: 0.054\n    lr_zs_high: 0.773\n    mlp_zs_high: 0.752\n    lr_vs_mlp_gap_high: 0.021\n    lr_ece_avg: 0.165\n    mlp_ece_avg: 0.184\n  result_rationale: 'MLP 在 English 上略优 (+1.9pp) 是因为 correctness signal 含有弱非线性成分——\n\n    某些层的 correctness 编码涉及特征交互。但 MLP 同时学到了 English-specific 的\n\n    非线性 pattern (e.g. English-specific token position interactions)，这些 pattern\n\n    在目标语言中不存在，导致 transfer 时引入负迁移。Linear probe 的 inductive bias\n\n    恰好匹配 correctness direction 的跨语言结构：线性投影只能捕获方向性信息，\n\n    而方向性信息正是跨语言共享的 (CKA 子空间分析支持)。差距在低资源语言最大\n\n    (LR +5.4pp vs MLP)，因为低资源表征的线性结构相对于英语更保守 (低维对齐\n\n    更强)，而 MLP 学到的非线性 feature 在低资源语境下完全失效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Probe Complexity × Transfer'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - LR\n    - MLP_2layer\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - EN Best AUROC\n      - 0.832\n      - 0.851\n      - 0.019\n    - - ZS Transfer Avg 20L\n      - 0.713\n      - 0.685\n      - -0.028\n    - - Relative Degradation\n      - 14.3%\n      - 19.5%\n      - +5.2pp\n    - - ZS Low-Resource Avg\n      - 0.635\n      - 0.581\n      - -0.054\n    - - ECE Avg\n      - 0.165\n      - 0.184\n      - 0.019\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Per-language transfer AUROC comparison (LR vs MLP), connected dots. MLP\n    consistently below LR, gap widens rightward (low-resource).'\n  analysis: 'Linear probe 是跨语言 transfer 的正确选择。MLP 的 +1.9pp English 优势远不足以\n\n    补偿 -2.8pp transfer 劣势。论文中以此证明 LR 作为默认 probe 的合理性。\n\n    '\n- name: Additional Benchmarks (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 最优 probes + CaCLR 在 Belebele 和 MMLU-ProX 上的泛化验证\n  expected_results:\n    belebele_qwen_en_auroc: 0.814\n    belebele_qwen_zs_avg: 0.698\n    belebele_qwen_caclr_avg: 0.741\n    belebele_qwen_pareto_rho: -0.61\n    belebele_llama_en_auroc: 0.793\n    belebele_llama_zs_avg: 0.671\n    belebele_llama_caclr_avg: 0.712\n    mmlupx_qwen_en_auroc: 0.839\n    mmlupx_qwen_zs_avg: 0.721\n    mmlupx_qwen_caclr_avg: 0.767\n    mmlupx_qwen_pareto_rho: -0.67\n    mmlupx_llama_en_auroc: 0.818\n    mmlupx_llama_zs_avg: 0.694\n    mmlupx_llama_caclr_avg: 0.738\n    per_lang_rank_corr_gmmlu_belebele: 0.89\n    per_lang_rank_corr_gmmlu_mmlupx: 0.93\n  result_rationale: 'Belebele 是 reading comprehension，与 GlobalMMLU (knowledge QA)\n    的 domain 不同。\n\n    Correctness direction 有轻微 domain dependency：probe 在 knowledge-heavy items\n\n    上学到的 correctness signal 不完全迁移到 comprehension tasks，EN AUROC 略降\n\n    (0.814 vs 0.832)。但 Pareto 结构高度一致 (ρ=-0.61 vs -0.65)，因为 depth-\n\n    transferability tradeoff 是架构特征而非 task 特征。MMLU-ProX 与 GlobalMMLU\n\n    domain overlap 大 (同属 knowledge QA)，结果最相似。Per-language ranking 跨\n\n    benchmark 高度稳定 (ρ=0.89-0.93)——在 GlobalMMLU 上 transfer 好的语言在\n\n    Belebele 上也好。CaCLR 增益在 Belebele 上略小 (+4.3pp vs +4.7pp) 但仍正面。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Qwen3-235B)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Domain\n    - EN_AUROC\n    - ZS_Avg\n    - CaCLR_Avg\n    - Pareto_rho\n    - CaCLR_Delta\n    rows:\n    - - GlobalMMLU\n      - Knowledge QA\n      - 0.832\n      - 0.713\n      - 0.76\n      - -0.65\n      - 0.047\n    - - Belebele\n      - Reading Comp\n      - 0.814\n      - 0.698\n      - 0.741\n      - -0.61\n      - 0.043\n    - - MMLU-ProX\n      - Knowledge QA\n      - 0.839\n      - 0.721\n      - 0.767\n      - -0.67\n      - 0.046\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S2: Per-language ZS AUROC scatter — GlobalMMLU (x) vs Belebele (y). High\n    correlation (ρ=0.89), all points near identity.'\n  analysis: '三 benchmark 一致性强。Pareto frontier 和 CaCLR gains 跨 domain replicate。\n\n    Belebele 的略低结果 underscores domain dependency 但不 undermine core claims。\n\n    '\n- name: Quantization Validation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: W4A16 vs FP16 (Llama) + GPTQ-INT4 vs FP16 (Qwen), 5 layers, 5% subset\n  expected_results:\n    llama_w4a16_vs_fp16:\n      auroc_diff_avg: 0.004\n      auroc_diff_max: 0.008\n      auroc_diff_per_layer:\n        L8: 0.002\n        L16: 0.003\n        L24: 0.005\n        L32: 0.006\n        L40: 0.008\n      cka_quantized_vs_fp16: 0.987\n      paired_t_p: 0.31\n    qwen_int4_vs_fp16:\n      auroc_diff_avg: 0.006\n      auroc_diff_max: 0.013\n      auroc_diff_per_layer:\n        L16: 0.003\n        L32: 0.005\n        L48: 0.006\n        L64: 0.008\n        L80: 0.013\n      cka_quantized_vs_fp16: 0.981\n      paired_t_p: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'W4A16 仅压缩权重 (4-bit)，激活保持 16-bit，因此对 correctness direction (线性\n\n    probe 的目标) 影响极小——probe 训练使用的是 activation vectors，不直接依赖权重\n\n    精度。GPTQ-INT4 的误差略大因为 4-bit 量化是更激进的压缩，且 Qwen3 有 94 层\n\n    导致误差累积更多。最大偏差 1.3pp 出现在最深层 L80 (误差在 94 层中逐层累积)。\n\n    所有差异在 paired t-test 下不显著 (p > 0.15)，CKA > 0.98 表示量化前后表征\n\n    几乎等价。论文中报告此验证可消除 reviewer \"INT4/W4A16 artifacts\" 的顾虑。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S4: Quantization Validation'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Quantization\n    - Avg_Delta_AUROC\n    - Max_Delta_AUROC\n    - CKA\n    - Paired_t_p\n    rows:\n    - - Llama 4 Scout\n      - W4A16\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.987\n      - 0.31\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - GPTQ-INT4\n      - 0.006\n      - 0.013\n      - 0.981\n      - 0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S3: Quantized vs FP16 AUROC per layer (error bar plot). All within noise\n    band.'\n  analysis: '量化不影响核心结论。最大偏差 1.3pp 远小于实验主要效应 (Pareto gap ~6pp,\n\n    CaCLR gain ~4.5pp)。放入 appendix 即可。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Geometric Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: CKA (linear kernel) 20 langs × all layers × 2 archs, partial correlation\n    + subspace angle\n  expected_results:\n    cka_partial_corr_controlling_depth: 0.42\n    cka_partial_corr_p: 0.008\n    same_layer_corr_by_depth:\n      25%:\n        rho: -0.48\n        p: 0.032\n      50%:\n        rho: -0.67\n        p: 0.001\n      75%:\n        rho: -0.73\n        p: <0.001\n    n_significant_layers: 18\n    qwen_cka_cliff:\n      location: L64 (68% depth)\n      cka_before: 0.72\n      cka_after: 0.41\n      drop_magnitude: 0.31\n    llama_cka_pattern: gradual decline, no cliff\n    llama_cka_at_L40: 0.52\n    llama_cka_at_L24: 0.71\n    qwen_pooled_rho: -0.58\n    qwen_pooled_p: <0.001\n    llama_pooled_rho: -0.43\n    llama_pooled_p: 0.002\n    between_lang_rho_at_50pct_depth: -0.67\n    between_lang_p_at_50pct_depth: 0.001\n    between_lang_rho_at_75pct_depth: -0.73\n    between_lang_p_at_75pct_depth: <0.001\n    correctness_subspace_angle_avg_deg: 12.3\n    correctness_subspace_angle_std_deg: 4.8\n    global_repr_angle_avg_deg: 38.7\n    global_repr_angle_std_deg: 9.2\n    subspace_angle_ratio: 3.15\n    cka_collapse_threshold: 0.35\n    langs_below_threshold_at_deepest:\n    - sw\n    - yo\n    - am\n    - my\n    per_lang_within_rho_significant: 14\n    per_lang_within_rho_avg: -0.48\n  result_rationale: 'Best tier 假设 \"CKA partial correlation 控制 depth 后仍显著\"。Partial\n    r=0.42\n\n    (p=0.008) 表示 CKA 对 transfer degradation 有独立于 depth 的解释力。核心\n\n    机制：correctness direction 占据低维语言无关子空间 (principal angle ~12°)，\n\n    而全局表征差异远大 (~39°)，ratio 3.15。这意味着即使两种语言的全局表征已\n\n    显著分化 (CKA 下降)，correctness 子空间仍可能保持对齐——直到 CKA 跌破临界\n\n    阈值 ~0.35，此时全局分化足够大以至于连低维子空间也被扰动。\n\n    Qwen3 的 CKA cliff (L64, 突降 0.31) 解释了为何 Qwen Pareto 清晰：在 cliff\n\n    之前 (L0-L60)，transfer 随 depth 缓慢退化；在 cliff 之后 (L64-L94)，transfer\n\n    急剧崩溃。这产生了强 Pareto (ρ=-0.65) 和清晰的 \"optimal transfer zone\" (L48-L60)。\n\n    Llama4 没有 cliff，CKA 渐降 → Pareto 弱且异质 (ρ=-0.33)。\n\n    Between-language 分析 (固定层, n=20) 是最强统计检验：在 50% depth，CKA 高的\n\n    语言 (zh 0.82, es 0.79) transfer 好，CKA 低的 (sw 0.48, am 0.42) transfer 差，\n\n    ρ=-0.67 (p=0.001)。在 75% depth 更强 (ρ=-0.73)，因为此处 CKA variance 更大。\n\n    20 languages 的密度使 per-language within-lang Spearman 首次有足够统计功效\n\n    (n=24 for Qwen vs MVP 的 n=9)：14/20 显著，avg ρ=-0.48，比 MVP pilot\n\n    (几乎全 n.s.) 大幅改善。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: CKA Partial Correlation Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Analysis\n    - Statistic\n    - Value\n    - p_value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Raw CKA-degradation pooled\n      - rho\n      - -0.64\n      - <0.001\n      - Confounded by depth\n    - - Partial corr controlling depth\n      - r\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.008\n      - CKA adds info beyond depth\n    - - Between-lang at 50% depth (n=20)\n      - rho\n      - -0.67\n      - 0.001\n      - Strongest cross-lang test\n    - - Between-lang at 75% depth (n=20)\n      - rho\n      - -0.73\n      - <0.001\n      - Even stronger deep\n    - - Within-lang avg (n=24 layers)\n      - rho\n      - -0.48\n      - varies\n      - 14/20 langs significant\n  - name: 'Table 12: Subspace Angle Analysis (Quantitative)'\n    columns:\n    - Measure\n    - Qwen3_235B\n    - Llama4_Scout\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Correctness subspace angle (avg)\n      - 11.2°\n      - 13.5°\n      - Small — cross-ling shared\n    - - Correctness subspace angle (std)\n      - 3.9°\n      - 5.7°\n      - More variable in Llama\n    - - Global representation angle (avg)\n      - 41.3°\n      - 36.1°\n      - Large — language-specific\n    - - Global/correctness ratio\n      - 3.69\n      - 2.67\n      - 'Qwen: correctness 4x more stable'\n    - - CKA cliff location\n      - 68% depth\n      - no cliff\n      - Architecture difference\n    - - CKA cliff magnitude\n      - 0.31\n      - N/A\n      - Qwen only\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6a: CKA heatmap (y=layer, x=language sorted by resource) — Qwen3. L64 处水平色带突变.'\n  - 'Fig 6b: CKA vs transfer degradation partial regression plot (controlling depth).\n    20 langs × multiple layers.'\n  - 'Fig 6c: Subspace angle comparison — bar pairs (correctness angle vs global angle)\n    per language pair. Correctness bars 远短于 global bars.'\n  - 'Fig 6d: CKA depth trajectory comparison — Qwen3 (cliff at L64) vs Llama4 (gradual).\n    Shaded region = transfer collapse zone (CKA < 0.35).'\n  analysis: 'CKA geometric analysis 成立 (partial r=0.42, p=0.008)，支撑 \"geometric analysis\"\n\n    framing。三层 evidence：(1) partial correlation 证明 CKA 有 depth 以外的解释力；\n\n    (2) between-language correlation (ρ=-0.67) 是最直接证据；(3) subspace angle ratio\n\n    3.15 提供几何直觉。CKA cliff 的有/无解释 Qwen vs Llama Pareto 差异。这是\n\n    discovery 级别 finding——连接了 representation geometry 和 practical transfer。\n\n    '\n- name: Linear Projection Sample Efficiency\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Parallel pairs 数量 (10-200) 对 linear projection transfer 的影响\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_L56:\n      pairs_10:\n        auroc: 0.739\n        delta: 0.011\n        ci_width: 0.034\n      pairs_20:\n        auroc: 0.758\n        delta: 0.03\n        ci_width: 0.023\n      pairs_50:\n        auroc: 0.79\n        delta: 0.062\n        ci_width: 0.015\n      pairs_100:\n        auroc: 0.798\n        delta: 0.07\n        ci_width: 0.01\n      pairs_200:\n        auroc: 0.802\n        delta: 0.074\n        ci_width: 0.007\n    llama_L32:\n      pairs_10:\n        auroc: 0.712\n        delta: 0.021\n        ci_width: 0.031\n      pairs_20:\n        auroc: 0.729\n        delta: 0.038\n        ci_width: 0.022\n      pairs_50:\n        auroc: 0.749\n        delta: 0.058\n        ci_width: 0.014\n      pairs_100:\n        auroc: 0.757\n        delta: 0.066\n        ci_width: 0.009\n      pairs_200:\n        auroc: 0.761\n        delta: 0.07\n        ci_width: 0.006\n    elbow_point: 50\n    marginal_gain_50_to_100: 0.008\n    marginal_gain_100_to_200: 0.004\n    caclr_equivalent_pairs: 35\n  result_rationale: 'Linear projection 学习 affine transformation 将 target 语言 correctness\n    subspace\n\n    旋转对齐到 English。Correctness direction 是低维的 (实际是 1D for LR probe)，\n\n    因此旋转矩阵的自由度极低——50 pairs 已充分约束 (条件数稳定)。10 pairs 时 CI\n\n    宽 0.034 (不稳定)，50 pairs CI 收窄至 0.015。超过 50 pairs，marginal gain\n\n    从 +2.2pp/50pairs 骤降至 +0.8pp/50pairs 和 +0.4pp/100pairs。CaCLR (无 parallel\n\n    pairs 的 labels) 等效于 ~35-pair linear projection (AUROC 0.763 vs pairs_35\n\n    插值约 0.76)，表明 MMD distributional matching 实现了部分但非完全的子空间\n\n    对齐。50 pairs 的实用意义大：几乎所有 GlobalMMLU 语言都有 600+ parallel items，\n\n    随机选 50 对即可达到 plateau。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Linear Projection Sample Efficiency (Qwen3, L56)'\n    columns:\n    - Pairs\n    - AUROC_Avg\n    - Delta_vs_ZS\n    - Marginal_Gain\n    - CI_95_Width\n    rows:\n    - - 10\n      - 0.739\n      - 0.011\n      - —\n      - 0.034\n    - - 20\n      - 0.758\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.019\n      - 0.023\n    - - 50\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.062\n      - 0.032\n      - 0.015\n    - - 100\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.01\n    - - 200\n      - 0.802\n      - 0.074\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.007\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Sample efficiency curve (log-scale x, AUROC y). Clear elbow at 50. Horizontal\n    line = CaCLR (0.763), intersects curve at ~35 pairs.'\n  analysis: '50 pairs 是实用甜点。Linear projection 在 50 pairs 时超过 CaCLR (0.790 vs\n\n    0.763)，但需要 parallel pairs with correctness labels。两方法互补：CaCLR\n\n    for zero-label 场景，linear projection for minimal-data 场景。\n\n    '\n- name: Full-Scale Probing Control Tasks\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Hewitt & Liang control tasks, 20 langs × 2 archs × all layers (扩展 MVP\n    English-only 结果)\n  expected_results:\n    selectivity_below_005_fraction: 0.1\n    low_sel_distribution:\n      early_layers_pct: 0.72\n      low_resource_pct: 0.68\n      overlap_early_AND_low: 0.54\n    qwen_selectivity_avg: 0.178\n    llama_selectivity_avg: 0.152\n    control_auroc_avg: 0.491\n    control_auroc_std: 0.012\n    control_auroc_max: 0.518\n    selectivity_grid_qwen:\n      early_HIGH: 0.045\n      early_MID: 0.036\n      early_LOW: 0.019\n      mid_HIGH: 0.142\n      mid_MID: 0.118\n      mid_LOW: 0.078\n      deep_HIGH: 0.261\n      deep_MID: 0.242\n      deep_LOW: 0.188\n    problem_zone_cells: 48\n    total_cells: 480\n    problem_zone_pct: 0.1\n    english_selectivity_deep_layers: 0.255\n    cross_lingual_selectivity_deep_layers_avg: 0.212\n    cross_lingual_selectivity_deep_layers_low_resource: 0.168\n  result_rationale: 'Control task AUROC 稳定在 ~0.49 (理论 0.50)，confirming permuted labels\n    不被\n\n    probe 学到——probing capacity 有限，不会 memorize random labels。10% 的 grid\n\n    cells 有 selectivity < 0.05，集中在 (early layers, LOW resource) 象限：\n\n    (1) Early layers (L0-L20 Qwen / L0-L12 Llama): correctness signal 尚未形成，\n\n    real probe 和 control probe 表现接近，selectivity ≈ 0；(2) Low-resource\n\n    languages: 较少的预训练数据 → correctness 编码更弱 → real probe 提升有限。\n\n    交叉：54% 的 low-selectivity cells 同时满足 early + low-resource。MVP 的\n\n    English-only plan_013 结果 (selectivity 集中在 L20-L27) 与 full-scale 一致，\n\n    但 cross-lingual extension 揭示了资源维度——英语深层 selectivity 0.255 vs\n\n    低资源深层 0.168。这本身是 methodological contribution：跨语言 probing 中\n\n    ~10% 的结果需谨慎解读。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S5: Selectivity by Depth × Resource Tier (Qwen3)'\n    columns:\n    - Depth_Range\n    - HIGH_Resource\n    - MID_Resource\n    - LOW_Resource\n    rows:\n    - - 0-33% (early)\n      - 0.045\n      - 0.036\n      - 0.019\n    - - 33-67% (mid)\n      - 0.142\n      - 0.118\n      - 0.078\n    - - 67-100% (deep)\n      - 0.261\n      - 0.242\n      - 0.188\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: Selectivity heatmap (y=layer, x=language sorted by resource). 左下角 (low\n    resource × early layer) 颜色最浅 (selectivity → 0).'\n  analysis: '10% capacity artifact rate 在 best tier [0.05, 0.15] 范围内。核心 probing\n\n    results (中深层 × 中高资源) selectivity > 0.10，genuine signal。Low-resource ×\n\n    early-layer zone 应在 paper 中标注为 \"interpret with caution\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 60层 Dense (FP16), 第三架构提供 dense vs MoE 对比\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.821\n    en_best_layer: 48\n    zs_transfer_auroc_avg_20lang: 0.702\n    zs_transfer_success_rate: 0.9\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - am\n    pareto_spearman_rho_global: -0.52\n    cka_pattern: gradual decline, onset deeper than Llama (no cliff)\n    cka_correctness_subspace_angle_avg: 13.1\n    caclr_delta_auroc_avg: 0.039\n  result_rationale: 'Dense 31B 没有 MoE routing，表征特化更均匀 (无 expert 分配的 language-specific\n\n    路径)，Pareto ρ=-0.52 介于 Qwen3 (ρ=-0.65, 强 MoE cliff) 和 Llama4 (ρ=-0.33,\n\n    弱 MoE) 之间。EN AUROC 0.821 反映 31B dense 的容量低于 235B 但高于 17B active。\n\n    CKA 渐降模式接近 Llama 但 onset 更深——dense model 在中间层保持更强的跨语言\n\n    共享 (无 expert routing 导致的早期分化)。Dense 架构的 Pareto 中等强度提供了\n\n    theory-consistent 的三点比较：cliff MoE (Qwen) > dense (Gemma) > gradual MoE\n\n    (Llama)。仅 yo/am 失败 (2/20)，success rate 0.90。CaCLR delta +3.9pp 低于\n\n    Qwen (+4.7pp) 但高于 Llama (+4.1pp)——dense 的初始 ZS transfer 已较好 (CKA\n\n    更高)，CaCLR 的 marginal room 稍小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: Three-Architecture Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Type\n    - EN_AUROC\n    - ZS_Avg\n    - Pareto_rho\n    - CKA_Pattern\n    - CaCLR_Delta\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - MoE (Int4)\n      - 0.832\n      - 0.713\n      - -0.65\n      - Cliff at 68%\n      - 0.047\n    - - Gemma4-31B\n      - Dense (FP16)\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.702\n      - -0.52\n      - Gradual, deep onset\n      - 0.039\n    - - Llama4-Scout\n      - MoE (W4A16)\n      - 0.811\n      - 0.684\n      - -0.33\n      - Gradual, early onset\n      - 0.041\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Three-architecture Pareto overlay — Qwen (steep, clear frontier), Gemma\n    (moderate), Llama (flat, scattered). 三种斜率直观展示 architecture dependence.'\n  analysis: '第三架构填充了 dense vs MoE 对比。Pareto 强度排序 (Qwen > Gemma > Llama) 与\n\n    架构差异一致：MoE cliff 产生最强 tradeoff，dense 渐降产生中等 tradeoff，\n\n    无 cliff 的 MoE 最弱。Camera-ready 的 n=3 架构虽仍不足以做因果归因 (type,\n\n    scale, layers, training data 均不同)，但三点一致的模式 strengthens \"architecture-\n\n    dependent tradeoff\" 的 observational claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended Language Coverage (50+)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 扩展至 50+ 语言 (GlobalMMLU + Belebele full sets)\n  expected_results:\n    total_languages: 53\n    zs_success_rate: 0.83\n    n_success: 44\n    n_fail: 9\n    fail_langs:\n    - am\n    - my\n    - yo\n    - si\n    - lo\n    - km\n    - gu\n    - or\n    - ne\n    pareto_rho_qwen_global_53: -0.62\n    pareto_rho_llama_global_53: -0.31\n    resource_tier_gradient_r2: 0.71\n    new_findings:\n      dravidian_cluster: ta/ml/kn 形成 cluster, ZS AUROC 0.64-0.68, transfer 特征接近 MID\n        tier\n      austronesian_cluster: id/ms/tl transfer 异常好 (0.72-0.74)，因为与英语的表征对齐度高\n      uralic_outlier: fi/hu ZS AUROC 差异大 (fi 0.69 vs hu 0.65)，尽管同为 Uralic\n    caclr_delta_avg_53: 0.044\n    caclr_delta_new_langs_avg: 0.041\n  result_rationale: '扩展至 53 语言后，成功率从 ~90% (20 langs) 降至 83% (53 langs)，因为新增\n\n    语言多为 extreme low-resource (si, lo, km 等)。但 Pareto ρ 和主要 patterns\n\n    保持稳定 (Qwen ρ=-0.62 vs -0.65 at 20 langs)，slight reduction 因为新增的\n\n    低资源语言削弱了 global correlation。Resource tier gradient 在更大样本下更\n\n    robust (R²=0.71, up from ~0.60 at 20 langs)。Austronesian 语言 (id/ms/tl)\n\n    transfer 异常好，因为这些语言在大模型预训练中常被 grouped with English-heavy\n\n    corpora (code-switching, romanization)。CaCLR 增益在新增语言上 (+4.1pp) 与\n\n    原 20 语言 (+4.7pp) 相当，confirming method generalizability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S6: Extended Language Coverage Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - 20_Langs\n    - 53_Langs\n    rows:\n    - - ZS Success Rate\n      - 95% (Qwen)\n      - 83%\n    - - Pareto ρ Qwen\n      - -0.65\n      - -0.62\n    - - Pareto ρ Llama\n      - -0.33\n      - -0.31\n    - - Resource Gradient R²\n      - ~0.60\n      - 0.71\n    - - CaCLR Δ AUROC avg\n      - 0.047\n      - 0.044\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: 53-language ZS success rate by resource tier. Clear gradient: HIGH ~98%,\n    MID ~90%, LOW ~65%.'\n  analysis: 'Camera-ready 扩展确认 core findings 跨 50+ 语言成立。9 种 fail 语言均为\n\n    extreme low-resource (预训练 tokens < 100M)，consistent with domain adaptation\n\n    theory 的 H-divergence 预测。Austronesian cluster 的高 transfer 是 interesting\n\n    secondary finding。'\n","numLines":1769,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1769}}}
